<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Mihela</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Mihela</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Mihela</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Mih</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha mwaluko cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mihela</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole cha 1 Mihela na 2 Mihela</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya 1 Mihela na 2 Mihela aho hamwande navyali chitabu chimwe chikulu. Nachigawanulwa na kuwa vitabu vili kuli Seputuajenti, iwele ndo Ilagano lya Katali kuli ndonga ya Chigilichi cha katali ng'hatu. Itagwa lya mwaluko lya chitabu cha Mihela kuli ndonga ya Chiebulaniya lina mana ya “Mbuli za mazuwa.” Wasomile wenji wa mbuli za Bibiliya wangukunda kota Esila nakandika vitabu avyo vya 1 Mihela na 2 Mihela na chitabu cha Esila na cha Nehemiya. Yalingwandika nakatumiya vitabu vimwenga kota vitabu vya Samweli hamwe na Wandewa kota ndo msisi wa kwandika vitabu avi. Wasomile wenji wa mbuli za Bibiliya wangukunda kota chitabu achi nachandichigwa kuli nusu ya keli ya kaline ya kahano (451-500), Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa, hanji nawali mhela ulingiwhana na mhela wa ukomu wa Esila.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya 1 Mihela na 2 Mihela vyangwaluka kwa kuwika matagwa ga wasekulu kulawa Adamu mbaka Abulahamu na wala wawele waluchize isi ya Isilaeli, hamwe na wala wahiluche kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi ako Babuloni. Kulawa aho, vitabu vya 1 Mihela na 2 Mihela vyangusimila kuwala mbuli za wanhu wa isi ya Isilaeli kwaluchila kuduma kwa ulongozi wa mndewa Sauli mbaka mhela wa kulakazwa kwa muji wa Yelusalemu. Kuli mhela weng'ha wa Mihela, yalingwandika nakandika kuwala ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu. Mndewa Daudi nayali yewichile goya ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha kuzenga ng'handa ya Nguluwi (1 Mihela 28-29), hamba Solomoni, mwana wa heye yawele nakahalila chigoda cha heye cha undewa nakaizenga ng'handa ayo (2 Mihela 2-7). Yalingwandika vitabu vya Mihela kangusimila kahi ndaze ng'handa ya Nguluwi vyoiwifigwe na vinhu vyeng'ha vya kuhongola na vinhu vyeng'ha vya sendi nyinji vyoviholigwe na awo walinguvaba (2 Mihela 36:15-21). Kuli kuduma, msitali wa kuduma wa chitabu achi (2 Mihela 36:23) wanguwika hazelu ndaze ng'handa ya Nguluwi ibomoligwe vyoiweza kuzenjigwa kahi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati kuli 1 Mihela</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula 1-9 zina matagwa ga wasekulu, wawele ndo kulawa Adamu mbaka Waisilaeli wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 10-29 zangusimila mbuli za kikala kwa Daudi na vyoyalongoze ako Isilaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Kulawa Adamu mbaka Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Mwaluko 5:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11:10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Adamu nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Seti, naye Seti nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Enoshi, naye Enoshi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Kenani, <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />naye Kenani nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Mahalaleli, naye Mahalaleli nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Yaledi, <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />naye Yaledi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Enoki, naye Enoki nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Metusela. Metusela kahi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Lameki, <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />naye Lameki nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Nuhu. Nuhu nayali na wana walume wadatu, wawele ndo Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Wana walume wa Yafeti nawali, Gomeli na Magogu na Madayi na Yavani na Tubali na Mesheki na Tilasi. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Wana walume wa Gomeli nawali, Ashikenasi na Lifati na Togama. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Wana walume wa Yavani nawali, Elisha na Talishishi na Kitimu na Lodanimu.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Wana walume wa Hamu nawali Kushi na Misili na Puti na Kanaani. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Wana walume wa Kushi nawali Seba na Havila na Sabuta na Lahama na Sabuteka. Wana walume wa Lahama nawali Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Kushi nayali mhaza wa Nimulodi, yawele nayali ndo mwamizi wa mwaluko muisi yeng'ha kuwa na mong'ho ng'hatu. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Misili nayali sekulu wa Waludi na Waanamu na Walehabi na Wanafutuhi <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />na Wapatilusi na Wakafutoli na Wakasiluhimu, wawele ndo mwaluko wa Wafilisti. <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Kanaani nayali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Sidoni, yawele ndo wa mwaluko na Heti. <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />Kanaani kahi nayali sekulu wa Wayebusi na Waamoli na Wagiligashi <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />na Wahivi na Waaliki na Wasini <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />na Waaluvadi na Wasemali na Wahamati.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Wana walume wa Shemu nawali Elamu na Ashulu na Alipakisadi na Ludi na Alamu. Wana walume wa Alamu nawali Usi na Huli na Geteli na Mesheki. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Alipakisadi nayali mhaza wa Shela na Shela nayali mhaza wa Ebeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Ebeli nayali na wana walume weli, wa mwaluko nakamchema Pelegi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pelegi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ulonzi awu wanguhulikwa kota ulonzi kusambaluka.</char></note>, kwa vila mhela awo wanhu wa isi nawali wasambaluche. Mwana wa keli wa Ebeli nayali yochemigwa Yokitani. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Yokitani nayali mhaza wa Alimodadi na Shelefu na Hasalimaweti na Yela <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />na Hadolamu na Usali na Dikila <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />na Obali na Abimaeli na Sheba <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />na Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Awo weng'ha nawali ndo wana walume wa Yokitani.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Lukolo lwa Abulahamu kulawa kwa Shemu ndo alu. Shemu nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Alipakisadi, naye Alipakisadi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Shela. <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Shela nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Ebeli, naye Ebeli nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Pelegi, naye Pelegi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Leu. <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Leu nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Selugi, naye Selugi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Naholi, naye Naholi nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Tela. <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />Tela nayali na mwana mlume, nayali yochemigwa Abulamu, yawele ndo Abulahamu.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Mwaluko 25:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Abulahamu nayali na wana weli walume, wawele ndo Ishimaeli na Isaka. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Alu ndo lulelo lwao, mwana wa mwaluko wa Ishimaeli nayali Nebayoti na wanji ndo Kedali na Adibeli na Mibisamu <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />na Mishima na Duma na Masa na Hadadi na Tema <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. Awo nawali ndo wana walume wa Ishimaeli.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Abulahamu nayali na mhawake yawele nayali yochemigwa Ketula. Ketula nakampondela Abulahamu wana walume wawele ndo Simulani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shua. Wana walume wa Yokishani nawali ndo Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Wana walume wa Midiani nawali ndo Efa na Efeli na Hanoki na Abida na Elidaya. Awo weng'ha nawali ndo walelwa wa Ketula.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Isaka, mwana mlume wa Abulahamu, nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Esau na Yakubu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yakubu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hamba Yakubu nakapegwa itagwa linji, liwele ndo Isilaeli.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Wana walume wa Esau nawali ndo Elifasi na Leueli na Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Wana walume wa Elifasi nawali ndo Temani na Omali na Sefo na Gatamu na Kenasi na Timuna na Amaleki. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Wana walume wa Leueli nawali ndo Nahati na Sela na Shama na Misa.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wenyeng'haye wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Mwaluko 36:20-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Wenyeng'haye wa mwaluko wa Edomu nawali wana walume wa Seili, wawele nawali ndo Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Wana walume wa Lotani nawali weli, wawele ndo Holi na Homamu. Lotani nayali na lumbulye yawele nayali yochemigwa Timuna. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Wana walume wa Shobali nawali ndo Alivani na Manahasi na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu. Wana walume wa Sibeoni nawali ndo Aya na Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Mwana mlume wa Ana nayali Dishoni. Wana walume wa Dishoni nawali ndo Hemudani na Eshibani na Itilani na Kelani. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Wana walume wa Eseli nawali ndo Bilihani na Saawani na Akani. Wana walume wa Dishani nawali ndo Usi na Alani.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandewa wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-39">Mwaluko 36:31-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Awa ndo wandewa wawele nawalongoza kuli isi ya Edomu, mhela Waisilaeli lowawele wang'hali kulongozwa na mndewa yoneche yula. Yumwe wa wandewa awo ndo Bela, mwana mlume wa Beoli, ayu nakailongoza isi ya Edomu, yawele muji wa heye wa kikala nawali uchemigwa Dinihaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Bela loyabagame, Yobabu, mwana mlume wa Sela, kulawa kuli muji wa Bosila, nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu ha heye. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Yobabu loyabagame, Hushamu wa isi ya Watemi, nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Hushamu loyabagame, Hadadi, mwana mlume wa Bedadi, nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu hake, nakekala kuli muji uwele nawali uchemigwa Aviti. Ayu ndo yawatowile na kuwasumya Wamidiani kuli isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Hadadi loyabagame, Samula, kulawa kuli muji wa Masileka, nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Samula loyabagame, Shauli, kulawa Lehoboti, muji uwele habehi na lwanda lwa Eyufulate, nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Shauli loyabagame, Baali-hanani, mwana mlume wa Akiboli, nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu hake. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Baali-hanani loyabagame, Hadadi nakawa mndewa na kulongoza honhu hake. Muji wa heye nawali uchemigwa Pau na itagwa lya mchewake Akiboli nalyali Mehetabeli, mhinza wa Matiledi, mzukulu wa Mesahabu.<verse eid="1CH 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Naye Hadadi nakabagama. Wakulu wa nhanzi ya Edomu nawali Timuna na Aluva na Yeteti <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />na Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />na Kenasi na Temani na Mibisali <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />na Magidieli na Ilamu.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Yakubu nayali na wana walume kumi na weli, wawele ndo Lubeni na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Sebuluni <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />na Dani na Yusufu na Benjamini na Nafutali na Gadi na Asheli.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Wana walume wa Yuda wawele nawapondigwa na Betishua Mkanaani, nawali ndo Eli na Onani na Shela. Eli mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Yuda, nayali yehile hali Mkulu Nguluwi, lelo Mkulu Nguluwi, nakamkopola. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Tamali, yawele nayali mche wa Eli, nakampondela Yuda wana walume weli, wawele ndo Pelesi na Sela. Wana weng'ha walume wa Yuda nawali wahano.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Pelesi nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Sela nayali na wana walume wahano, Simuli na Etani na Hemani na Kalikoli na Dala. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Mwana mlume wa Kalimi nayali Akali. Ayu nakawegalila Waisilaeli magazo kwa kuleka kuwa wa kukundigwa kwa kuhola vinhu viwichigwe chiuyeng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Etani nayali na mwana mlume, itagwa lyake nalyali Asaliya.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa mndewa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Wana walume wa Hesiloni nawali ndo Yelameeli na Lamu na Kelubayi.<verse eid="1CH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Lamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Aminadabu, naye Aminadabu nayali na mwana mlume nayali yochemigwa Nashoni, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Nashoni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Salima, naye Salima nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Boasi, <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />naye Boasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Obedi, naye Obedi nayali na mwana mlume, yawele nayali yochemigwa Yese.<verse eid="1CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Yese nayali na wana walume saba wawele ndo Eliyabu, yawele ndo mlelwa wa heye wa mwaluko, na wa keli ndo Abinadabu na wa kadatu ndo Shimeya <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />na wa kane ndo Netanaeli na wa kahano ndo Ladayi <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />na wa sita ndo Osemu na wa saba ndo Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Walumbu wa hewo nawali Seluiya na Abigaili. Wana walume wa Seluiya nawali wadatu wawele ndo Abishayi na Yoabu na Asaheli. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigaili nakamponda Amasa, mhaza wa Amasa nayali yochemigwa Yeteli, Mwishimaeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Hesiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Hesiloni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Kalebu. Ayo Kalebu nayali na wache weli. Kulawa kwa wache awo, wawele ndo Asuba na Yelioti, Kalebu nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Yesheli na Shobabu na Alidoni. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Asuba loyabagame, Kalebu nakamhesa Efulata, yawele nakamponda Huli. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Huli nayali na mwana mlume, yawele nayali yochemigwa Uli, naye Uli nayali na mwana mlume, yawele nayali yochemigwa Besaleli.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Hesiloni loyawele na miyaka makumi sita, nakamhesa mhinza wa Makili. Makili nayali ndo mhaza wa Gileadi. Mhinza ayo nakampondela Hesiloni mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Segubu. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Segubu nayali na mwana mlume nayali yochemigwa Yaili, yawele nakalongoza miji mikulu makumi meli na jidatu kuli isi ya Gileadi, <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />ila undewa wa Geshuli na Alamu naumtowa na kumboka miji ja Havoti-yaili na Kenati na vijiji vyake. Miji jeng'ha najali makumi sita. Awo weng'ha nawali ndo walelwa wa Makili, mhaza wa Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Hesiloni loyabagame, mwana wa heye yawele ndo Kalebu nakamhesa Efulata, yawele ndo yafililwe na mlume wa heye Hesiloni. Efulata nakampondela Kalebu mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ashuli, yawele kahi ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Tekowa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yelameeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Yelameeli nayali mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Hesiloni. Wana wa heye ndo Lamu, yawele nayali ndo mlelwa wa heye mlume wa mwaluko, na Buna na Oleni na Osemu na Ahiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Yelameeli nayali na mche yunji itagwa lyake Atala. Ayu nakampondela Yelameeli mwana mlume, itagwa lyake nalyali Onamu. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Wana walume wa Lamu, yawele ndo mlelwa mlume wa mwaluko wa Yelameeli, nawali Maasi na Yamini na Ekeli. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Wana walume wa Onamu nawali Shamayi na Yada. Nawo wana walume wa Shamayi nawali Nadabu na Abishuli.<verse eid="1CH 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Abishuli nakamhesa Abihaili, naye nakampondela wana walume weli, wawele ndo Abani na Molidi. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Wana walume wa Nadabu nawali, Seledi na Apaimu, ila Seledi nakabagama yalihela mwana. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Apaimu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ishi. Ishi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sheshani, naye Sheshani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Alayi.<verse eid="1CH 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Yada, mng'holoze Shamayi, nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Yeteli na Yonatani. Yeteli nakabagama yalihela mwana. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Yonatani nayali na wana weli, Peleti na Sasa. Weng'ha awo ndo walelwa wa Yelameeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Sheshani nayali yalihela wana walume, nayali na wahinza hela. Hihyo du, nayali na mpogozi mlume wa Chimisili, itagwa lyake nalyali Yaliha. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Ahyo, Sheshani nakamhesela mpogozi wa heye, Yaliha, yumwe wa wahinza wa heye. Mhinza ayo nakamponda Atayi. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Atayi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Natani, naye Natani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sabadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Sabadi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Efilali, naye Efilali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Obedi, <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />naye Obedi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yehu, naye Yehu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asaliya, <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />naye Asaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Helesi, naye Helesi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eleasa, <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />naye Eleasa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sisimayi, naye Sisimayi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shalumu, <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />naye Shalumu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yekamiya, naye Yekamiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Elishama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wanji wa Kalebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Kalebu, mng'holoze Yelameeli, nayali na wana walume weli. Mlelwa wa mwaluko ndo Mesha. Mesha nayali ndo mhaza wa Sifu. Mwana mlume wa keli wa Kalebu nayali yochemigwa Malesha, naye Malesha nayali mhaza wa Hebuloni. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Hebuloni nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Kola na Tapua na Lekemu na Shema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Shema nayali mhaza wa Lahamu na Lahamu nayali mhaza wa Yolikeamu. Lekemu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shamayi, <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />naye Shamayi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Maoni, naye Maoni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Beti-suli.<verse eid="1CH 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Kalebu nayali na mhawake, yawele nayali yochemigwa Efa. Ayu nakampondela Kalebu wana walume wanji wadatu, wawele ndo Halani na Mosa na Gasesi. Halani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nakamchema Gasesi.<verse eid="1CH 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Munhu yawele nayali yochemigwa Yadayi, nayali na wana walume sita, wawele ndo Legemu na Yotamu na Geshani na Peleti na Efa na Shaafu.<verse eid="1CH 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Kalebu nayali na mhawake yunji itagwa lyake Maaka. Ayo Maaka nakampondela Kalebu wana, wawele ndo Shebeli na Tilihana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Hamba Kalebu na Maaka nawali na wana wanji walume weli wawele ndo Shaafu na Sheva. Shaafu nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Madimana. Sheva nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Makibena na Gibeya. Kalebu kahi nayali na mhinza yawele nayali yochemigwa Akisa.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Kalebu nayali na walelwa wanji kahi kwa mchewake Efulata. Huli, mlelwa wa mwaluko nayali na wana walume wadatu, wawele ndo Shobali na Salima na Helefu. Shobali nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Kiliati-yealimu. <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />Salima nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Betelehemu. Helefu nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Beti-gadeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Shobali yawele ndo mhaza wa Kiliati-yealimu, nayali kahi mhaza wa wanhu wa Halowe na nusu ya wenyeng'haye wa kuli muji wa Menuhoti, <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />hamwe na ng'holo za Kiliati-yealimu ziwele ndo Waitili na Waputi na Washumati na Wamishilayi. Kahi Wasolati na Waeshitaoli nawalawa kuli wanhu awo.<verse eid="1CH 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Salima yawele ndo mhaza wa Betelehemu, nayali sekulu wa Wanetofahi na Waatoti-beti-yoabu na nusu ya Wamenahati wawele ndo Wasoli. <verse eid="1CH 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />Ng'holo zilinguwinza za walingwandika nazikala kuli muji wa Yabesi. Ng'holo azo ndo za Watilati na Washimeati na Wasukati. Hewo ndo Wakeni wawele nawalawa kuli lulelo lwa Hamati, sekulu wa ng'handa ya Lekabu.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa mndewa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Awa ndo wana wa mndewa Daudi wawele nawapondigwa mhela loyawele ako Hebuloni. Mlelwa wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Amunoni, mayake nayali yochemigwa Ahinoamu, Myesileeli. Mlelwa wa keli nayali yochemigwa Danyeli, mayake nayali yochemigwa Abigaili, Mkalimeli. <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Wa kadatu ndo Abusalomu, mayake nayali yochemigwa, Maaka, mhinza wa Talimayi, mndewa wa Geshuli. Wa kane nayali yochemigwa Adoniya, mayake nayali yochemigwa Hagiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />Wa kahano nayali yochemigwa Shefatiya, mayake nayali yochemigwa Abitali. Wa sita nayali yochemigwa Itileamu, mayake nayali yochemigwa Egila. <verse eid="1CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Weng'ha sita nawapondigwa ako Hebuloni, kuwele Daudi nakalongoza kwa miyaka saba na nusu. Daudi nakalongoza Ako Yelusalemu kwa miyaka makumi gadatu na jidatu. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Awa ndo wana wa mndewa Daudi wawele nawapondigwa mhela loyawele Yelusalemu. Batisheba mchewake, mhinza wa Aminieli, nakampondela wana walume wane, wawele ndo Shimeya na Shobabu na Natani na Solomoni.<verse eid="1CH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Daudi kahi nayali na wana wanji walume tisa, wawele ndo Ibihali na Elishuwa na Elipeleti <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />na Noga na Nefegi na Yafiya <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />na Elishama na Eliyada na Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Awo weng'ha nawali wana walume wa Daudi, kuleka wala wanji wawele nawapondigwa na waha wake. Tamali nayali lumbulyao.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa mndewa Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Solomoni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Lehoboamu, naye Lehoboamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Abiya, naye Abiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asa, naye Asa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yehoshafati, <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />naye Yehoshafati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yeholamu, naye Yeholamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahasiya, naye Ahasiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yoashi. <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />Yoashi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Amasiya, naye Amasiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Usiya, naye Usiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yotamu, <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />naye Yotamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahasi, naye Ahasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Hesekiya, naye Hesekiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Manase, <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />naye Manase nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Amoni, naye Amoni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yosiya. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Yosiya nayali na wana walume wane. Yohanani nayali wa mwaluko na wa keli nayali Yehoyakimu na wa kadatu nayali Sedekiya na wa kane nayali Shalumu. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Yehoyakimu nayali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Yekoniya na Sedekiya.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Yekoniya, yawele nakaholigwa na Wababuloni na kuhilikwa kuli isi ya chijenzi, nayali na wana walume saba wawele ndo Sheatieli <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />na Malikilamu na Pedaya na Shenasali na Yekamiya na Hoshama na Nedabiya. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Wana walume wa Pedaya nawali Selubabeli na Shimeyi. Selubabeli nayali na wana walume, wawele ndo Meshulamu na Hananiya na mhinza yalinguchemigwa Shelomiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Selubabeli kahi nayali na wana walume wanji wahano wawele ndo Hashuba na Oheli na Belekiya na Hasadiya na Yushabi-hesedi.<verse eid="1CH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Walelwa wa Hananiya nawali Pelatiya na Yeshaya na Lefaya na Alinani na Obadiya na Shekaniya. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Shekaniya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shemaya na nayali na wazukulu walume wahano, wawele ndo Hatushi na Igali na Baliya na Nealiya na Shafati, weng'ha nawali wanhu sita. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Wana walume wa Nealiya nawali Eliehonayi na Hesekiya na Asilikamu, weng'ha nawali wanhu wadatu. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Eliehonayi nayali na wana walume saba wawele ndo Hodaviya na Eliashibu na Pelaya na Akubu na Yohanani na Delaya na Anani, weng'ha nawali wanhu saba.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Wana walume wa Yuda nawali Pelesi na Hesiloni na Kalimi na Huli na Shobali. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Shobali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Leaya. Leaya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yahati, naye Yahati nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Ahumayi na Lahadi. Alo nalwali ndo lukolo lwa Wasolati.<verse eid="1CH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Wana walume wa Etamu nawali ndo Yesileeli na Ishima na Idibashi. Wana awo nawali na lumbulyao yawele nayali yochemigwa Haseleponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penueli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Gedoli. Eseli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Husha. Awo nawali ndo walelwa wa Huli, mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Efulata na Kalebu, yawele ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Betelehemu.<verse eid="1CH 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Ashuli, yawele ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Tekowa, nayali na wache weli wawele ndo Hela na Naala. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Naala nakaponda wana walume wane wawele ndo Ahusamu na Hefeli na Temeni na Haahashitali. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Hela nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Seleti na Sohali na Etinani na Kosi. <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Kosi nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Anubi na Sobeba, kahi nayali ndo sekulu wa ivyazi lyeng'ha lya Ahaliheli, mwana wa Halumu.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Nakwali na munhu yalinguchemigwa Yabesi, yawele nayali yatogoligwe kusinda wang'holoze weng'ha. Mayake nakamha itagwa lya Yabesi kwa vila nakamponda kwa usungu ng'hatu. <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Yabesi nakamlanda Nguluwi wa Isilaeli yolonga, “Gwa Nguluwi, ndangukudedeza unhambichize na konjeza mbaka ja isi yondilingikala. Moko wa hegwe uwe hamwe na heni na unyamile kwa mbuli yoneche ya usungu leka ndeche kulumizwa.” Nguluwi nakamha goyalandile.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Kelubu mng'holoze Shuha, nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mehili, naye Mehili nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eshitoni. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Eshitoni nayali na wana walume wadatu, wawele ndo Beti-lafa na Paseya na Tehina. Tehina nayali sekulu wa muji wa Nahashi. Awa ndo walelwa wawele nawali wochikala kuli muji wa Leka.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Wana walume wa Kenasi nawali ndo Otinieli na Selaya. Wana walume wa Otinieli nawali ndo Hatati na Meonatayi. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meonatayi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ofula. Selaya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yoabu, kahi nayali ndo sekulu wa wawanzi walingikala kuli ibindi lilinguchemigwa Ge-halashimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ge-halashimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ulonzi awu una mana ya ibindi lya wawanzi.</char></note>.<verse eid="1CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Kalebu, mwana mlume wa Yefune, nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Ilu na Ela na Naamu. Mwana mlume wa Ela nayali yochemigwa Kenasi. <verse eid="1CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Wana walume wa Yehaleleli nawali ndo Sifu na Sifa na Tiliya na Asaleli. <verse eid="1CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Esila nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Yeteli na Meledi na Efeli na Yaloni. Meledi nakamhesa Bitiya, mhinza wa Falao, yawele nakampondela wana wadatu. Wana awo ndo Miliamu na Shamayi na Ishiba. Ishiba nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Eshitemoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Meledi nayali na mche yunji kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda, yawele nakawaponda Yeledi na Hebeli na Yekutieli. Yeledi ndo yawele nayali mhaza wa Gedoli. Hebeli ndo yawele nayali mhaza wa Soko. Yekutieli ndo yawele nayali mhaza wa Sanowa.<verse eid="1CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Nakwali na munhu yalinguchemigwa Hodiya, yawele nakamhesa lumbulye Nahamu. Lulelo lwa Hodiya ndo Keila, yawele ndo mhaza wa lukolo lwa Wagalimi, na Eshitemoa, yawele ndo mhaza wa lukolo lwa Wamaakati.<verse eid="1CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Walelwa walume wa Shimoni nawali ndo Amunoni na Lina na Beni-hanani na Tiloni. Ishi nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Soheti na Beni-soheti.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21-22" />Shela nayali yumwe wa wana walume wa Yuda. Shela nayali na walelwa wawele ndo Eli na Laada na Yokimu na wanhu wawele nawekala kuli muji wa Koseba na Yoashi na Salafi. Eli nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Leka. Laada nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Malesha, yawele ndo lukolo lwa wakola mijito ja kutawa nguwo za kitani inojile, wawele nawali wochikala kuli muji wa Beti-ashibeya. Yoashi na Salafi, wawele nawalongoza ako Moabu, wawele hamba nawahiluka Lehemu. Mbuli azi ndo za katali ng'hatu. <verse eid="1CH 4:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Awa nawali ndo walingulumba vinhu vya ilongo wawele nawali wochikala kuli muji wa Netaimu na muji wa Gedela, kahi nawali ndo vitumagwa wa mndewa.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Simeoni nayali na wana walume wahano wawele ndo Nemueli na Yamini na Yalibu na Sela na Sauli. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Mwana mlume wa Sauli nayali yochemigwa Shalumu, naye Shalumu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mibisamu, naye Mibisamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mishima. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Mishima nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Hamueli, naye Hamueli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sakuli, naye Sakuli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shimeyi. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Shimeyi nayali na wana walume kumi na sita na wahinza sita, ila wang'holoze hawawele na wana wenji na ng'holo zawo kahi hazonjezeche kota nhanzi ya Yuda.<verse eid="1CH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />Nawali wochikala kuli miji jilinguchemigwa Beeli-sheba na Molada na Hasali-shuali <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />na Biliha na Esemu na Toladi <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />na Betueli na Holima na Sikilagi <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />na Beti-malikaboti na Hasali-susimu na Beti-bili na Shaalaimu. Aji najali miji ja hewo mbaka kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa mndewa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Kahi, nawekala kuli miji jinji jihano jiwele ndo Etamu na Aini na Limoni na Tokeni na Ashani, <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />hamwe na vijiji vya hafungo mwa miji ajo ako Baali. Aho nahali ndo haluga ha hewo, nawo nawawika kukumbuchila kuwala ng'holo zawo.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Wanhu wawele nawali wakulu wa ng'holo zawo nawali ndo Meshobabu na Yamuleki na Yosha, mwana wa Amasiya <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />na Yoeli na Yehu, mwana wa Yoshibiya, mwana wa Selaya, mwana wa Asieli. <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Kahi nakwali na wakulu wa ng'holo wawele ndo Elionayi na Yaakoba na Yeshohaya na Asaya na Adieli na Yesimieli na Benaya <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />na Sisa, mwana wa Shifi, mwana wa Aluni, mwana wa Yedaya, mwana wa Shimuli, mwana wa Shemaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Wanhu awa wandichigwe matagwa gawo aho hachanya nawali ndo vilongozi wa ng'holo zawo. Ivyazi lyawo nalonjezeka ng'hatu. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />Nawenela mbaka habehi na muji wa Gedoli, ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mwa ibindi, wopala honhu ha kudimila kwa chiwalo cha ming'holo ja hewo. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Aho, nawali na honhu hakulu na hawele goya kudimila ming'holo na isi nayali na honhu ha kuhega iwele na kikala goya. Wamwe wa Wahamu nawekala ako katali.<verse eid="1CH 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa Hesekiya, mndewa wa Yuda, wanhu wala wawele matagwa gawo nagandichigwa nawaluta kuli isi ayo. Nawawatowa Wahamu hali haluga hawo hamwe na Wameuni, wawele nawali ako, nawawasumya ng'hatu, kulawa mhela awo. Hamba nawekala ako kwa vila nakwali na honhu hanojile ha kudimila ming'holo ja hewo. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Wanhu wa nhanzi ya Simeoni wafichile miya zihano, wawele nawali wolongozwa na Pelatiya na Nealiya na Lefaya na Usieli, wawele ndo wana walume wa Ishi, nawaivaba isi ya vidunda vya Seili. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Nawawakopola Waamaleki wasigale, nawo wang'hali wangikala ako kulawa mhela awo.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Lubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Awa ndo walelwa wa Lubeni, yawele ndo mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Isilaeli. Hanga Lubeni nayali mlelwa wa mwaluko, hachi ya heye ya ulelwa wa mwaluko nakapegwa Yusufu mng'holoze, kwa vila Lubeni nakambasa soni mhaza wa heye kwa kuwasa na mha wa mhaza wa heye. Ahyo, Lubeni hawichigwe kuli matagwa ga lukolo lwa hewo kwa kuwinza hachi ya heye ya mlelwa wa mwaluko. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Hanga nhanzi ya Yuda nayali na mong'ho ng'hatu kusinda nhanzi zinji na vilongozi nawalawa amo, ila hachi ya mlelwa wa mwaluko nakapegwa Yusufu. <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Wana walume wa Lubeni nawali ndo Hanoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kalimi.<verse eid="1CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Walelwa walume wa Yoeli kulawa lulelo lumwe mbaka lulelo lunji nalwali ndo Shemaya na Gogi na Shimeyi <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />na Mika na Leaya na Baali <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />na Beela, yawele nakaholigwa na mndewa Tigilati-pileseli wa Ashulu na kuhilikwa kuli isi ya chijenzi. Beela nayali chilongozi wa Walubeni.<verse eid="1CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Vilongozi wa ng'holo azi matagwa gawo nagandichigwa kwa kiwhana na kukumbuchila kwa nhanzi ya Lubeni. Vilongozi awo ndo Yeieli na Sekaliya <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />na Bela, mwana wa Asasi, mzukulu wa Shema, wa lukolo lwa Yoeli. Lukolo alo nalwali luchikala ako Aloeli na kuli honhu heng'ha ha kasikazini mbaka Nebo na Baali-meoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />Kwa vila migongolo ja hewo najali jonjezeche ako Gileadi, nawenela kuli ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mbaka hafungo ha kugunuche kuwele nakwenela mbaka kuli lwanda lwa Eyufulate.<verse eid="1CH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa mndewa Sauli, nhanzi ya Lubeni nayaluka kitowa na Wahagali, nawawakopola na kuihola isi ya hewo. Hamba nawekala kuli mihema ja Wahagali kuli honhu heng'ha ha kolilawilaga isanya mwa Gileadi.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Wanhu wa nhanzi ya Gadi nawekala kuli ubanzi wa kasikazini mwa nhanzi ya Lubeni kuli isi ya Bashani, iwele nayenela kulawa ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mbaka kuli muji wa Saleka. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Yoeli nayali ndo chaluchizo cha lukolo lulongoze na Shafamu nayali chaluchizo cha lukolo lwa keli. Yanayi na Shafati nawali chaluchizo cha lukolo lunji ako Bashani. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Wang'holozawo kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo nawali saba, wawele ndo Mikaeli na Meshulamu na Sheba na Yolayi na Yakani na Siya na Ebeli.<verse eid="1CH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Weng'ha awa nawali walelwa walume wa Abihaili, mwana wa Huli, mwana wa Yaloya, mwana wa Gileadi, mwana wa Mikaeli, mwana wa Yeshishayi, mwana wa Yado, mwana wa Busi. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Ahi, mwana mlume wa Abidieli, mzukulu wa Guni, nayali chilongozi wa ng'holo zawo. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Nawekala Gileadi kuli isi ya Bashani na miji jake na kuli honhu ha kudimila ha Shaloni mbaka kuli mbaka ja isi. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Awo weng'ha nawandichigwa kuli kukumbuchila kwa ng'holo zawo, kuli mazuwa ga Yotamu, mndewa wa Yuda na Yeloboamu, mndewa wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi wa nhanzi za kolilawilaga isanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Nhanzi za Lubeni na Gadi na Manase ya ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, nazali na wamizi wazidahe elufu makumi gane na wane na miya saba na makumi sita (44,760), wawele nawalanguswa goya kutumiya ngawo na mipanga na mipinde na misale. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Nawetowa na nhanzi za Wahagali na Wayetuli na Wanafishi na Wanodabu. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Nawali wochitumbila kwa Nguluwi na nawamlanda yawatanze, naye nakedichila kulanda kwa hewo na kuwawika Wahagali hamwe na goloko wa hewo mmoko mwawo. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Nawahola migongolo ja Wahagali, jiwele ndo ngamiya elufu makumi gahano (50,000) na ming'holo lachi mbili na elufu makumi gahano (250,000) na midogowi elufu mbili (2,000), kahi nawawahola wapogozi wa ngondo lachi imwe (100,000). <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Nawawakopola wang'honyo wenji lukami kwa vila ngondo ayo nayali ndo ya Nguluwi. Nawalutilila kikala kuli isi ayo mbaka mhela wa kuluta kuli isi ya chijenzi loufichile.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Manase wa kulawa kolilawilaga isanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Wanhu wa Manase wa kulawa kolilawilaga isanya nawekala kuli isi ya Bashani. Nawonjezeka lukami, nawenela ubanzi wa kasikazini mbaka Baali-helimoni na Senili na chidunda cha Helimoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Wakulu wa ng'holo za nhanzi ayo nawali ndo Efeli na Ishi na Elieli na Asilieli na Yelemiya na Hodaviya na Yadieli. Weng'ha nawali wamizi wazidahe na wazeleche ng'hatu na ndo vilongozi wa ng'holo azo.<verse eid="1CH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhanzi za kolilawilaga isanya zanguholigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Ila wanhu nawambelenhuka Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hewo, nawadita kota wang'hondwa kwa kujifugamila milungu ja wenyeng'haye wa isi azo, wawele Nguluwi nakawadumya hali hewo. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Lelo, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli nakamwimiza Pulu, yawele nayali ndo mndewa wa Ashulu, yawele kahi nayali yozeleka kota Tigilati-pileseli. Ayo nakaivaba isi ya hewo na kuwahola Walubeni na Wagadi na nhanzi ya Manase ya kolilawilaga isanya na kuwahilika mbaka kuli isi za chijenzi ako Halahi na Haboli na Hala na hafungo ha lwanda lwa Gosani, kuwele nawali wochikala kulawa mhela awo.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa watambika wakulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Lawi nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali.<verse eid="1CH 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Kohati nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Amulamu na Isihali na Hebuloni na Usieli.<verse eid="1CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Amulamu nayali na wana walume weli na mhinza, wawele ndo Aluni na Musa na Miliamu. Aluni nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Nadabu na Abihu na Eleasali na Itamali.<verse eid="1CH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Eleasali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Finehasi, naye Finehasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Abishua, <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />naye Abishua nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Buki, naye Buki nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Usi, <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />naye Usi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Selahiya, naye Selahiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Melayoti. <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Melayoti nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Amaliya, naye Amaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />naye Ahitubu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sadoki, naye Sadoki nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahimaasi. <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />Ahimaasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asaliya, naye Asaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yohanani, <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />naye Yohanani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asaliya. Asaliya ndo yakolile mijito ja utambika kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi iwele naizenjigwa na mndewa Solomoni ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Asaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Amaliya, naye Amaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />naye Ahitubu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sadoki, naye Sadoki nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shalumu. <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Shalumu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Hilikiya, naye Hilikiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asaliya, <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />naye Asaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Selaya, naye Selaya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yehosadaki. <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Yehosadaki nakahilikwa kuli isi ya chijenzi, mhela uwele Mkulu Nguluwi loyawahiliche wanhu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu kuli isi ya chijenzi, kwa moko wa mndewa Nebukadinesa.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lunji lwa Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Lawi nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Chila yumwe wa hewo kahi nayali na wana. Gelishoni nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Libini na Shimeyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Kohati nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Amulamu na Isihali na Hebuloni na Usieli. <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Melali nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Mahili na Mushi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:19">Alu ndo lulelo lwa Walawi kwa kiwhana na ng'holo zawo. <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Awa ndo walelwa wa Gelishoni. Gelishoni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Libini, naye Libini nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yahati, naye Yahati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sima, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />naye Sima nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yowa, naye Yowa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ido, naye Ido nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sela, naye Sela nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yeatelayi.<verse eid="1CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Awa ndo walelwa wa Kohati. Kohati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Aminadabu, naye Aminadabu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Kola, naye Kola nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asili, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />naye Asili nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Elikana, naye Elikana nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ebiasafu, naye Ebiasafu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asili, <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />naye Asili nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Tahati, naye Tahati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ulieli, naye Ulieli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Usiya, naye Usiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shauli.<verse eid="1CH 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Wana walume wa Elikana nawali weli, wawele ndo Amasayi na Ahimoti. <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />Ahimoti nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Elikana, naye Elikana nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sofayi, naye Sofayi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Nahati, <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />naye Nahati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eliabu, naye Eliabu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yelohamu, naye Yelohamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Elikana. <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Wana walume wa Samweli nawali weli, wawele ndo Yoeli na Abiya. Yoeli nayali ndo mlelwa wa mwaluko na wa keli nayali ndo Abiya.<verse eid="1CH 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Awa ndo walelwa wa Melali. Melali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mahili, naye Mahili nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Libini, naye Libini nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shimeyi, naye Shimeyi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Usa, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />naye Usa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shimeya, naye Shimeya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Hagiya, naye Hagiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Asaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walingwimba wawele nawahaguligwa na mndewa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Matagwa galinguya ndo ga wanhu wawele mndewa Daudi nakawawika leka wawe vilongozi wa walingwimba kuli ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi hala lowasindile kuwika isanduku lya ilagano mgati mwa ihema alyo. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Nawakola mijito ja hewo ja kwimba hali ihema lya Nguluwi mbaka mhela mndewa Solomoni loyazenjile ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu. Nawali wokola mijito ja hewo goya kota vyoilinguganigwa. <verse eid="1CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Wanhu awo wawele nawali wokola mijito ja kwimba hamwe na wana wa hewo nawali ndo Hemani, kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Kohati yawele nayali yalingwimba. Hemani nayali mwana wa Yoeli, mwana wa Samweli, <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />mwana wa Elikana, mwana wa Yelohamu, mwana wa Elieli, mwana wa Toa, <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />mwana wa Sufu, mwana wa Elikana, mwana wa Mahati, mwana wa Amasayi, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />mwana wa Elikana, mwana wa Yoeli, mwana wa Asaliya, mwana wa Sefaniya, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />mwana wa Tahati, mwana wa Asili, mwana wa Ebiasafu, mwana wa Kola, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />mwana wa Isihali, mwana wa Kohati, mwana wa Lawi, mwana wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Asafu nayali ubanzi wa kudilo wa Hemani. Lukolo lwake kulawa kwa Lawi nalwali hino, Asafu, mwana wa Belekiya, mwana wa Shimeya, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />mwana wa Mikaeli, mwana wa Baaseya, mwana wa Malikiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />mwana wa Etini, mwana wa Sela, mwana wa Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />mwana wa Etani, mwana wa Sima, mwana wa Shimeyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />mwana wa Yahati, mwana wa Gelishoni, mwana wa Lawi.<verse eid="1CH 6:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Etani, kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Melali, nayali ubanzi wa kumoso wa Hemani. Lukolo lwake kulawa kwa Lawi nalwali hino, Etani, mwana wa Kishi, mwana wa Abidi, mwana wa Maluki, <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />mwana wa Hashabiya, mwana wa Amasiya, mwana wa Hilikiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />mwana wa Amusi, mwana wa Bani, mwana wa Shemeli, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />mwana wa Mahili, mwana wa Mushi, mwana wa Melali, mwana wa Lawi.<verse eid="1CH 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Walawi wayao wanji wasigale nawapegwa mijito jinji kuli honhu helile ha ihema lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Aluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Aluni na walelwa wa heye ndo wawele nawali wolavya nhambiko hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko za kulakazwa na kahi hali honhu ha kufunyizila ubani. Nawakola mijito jeng'ha jiwele najiganigwa hali honhu helile ng'hatu leka kuiditila Isilaeli uhanyisi. Nawagadita aga geng'ha kota vyowalajizwe na Musa, chitumagwa wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Awa ndo walelwa wa Aluni. Aluni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eleasali, naye Eleasali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Finehasi, naye Finehasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Abishua, <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />naye Abishua nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Buki, naye Buki nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Usi, naye Usi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Selahiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />naye Selahiya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Melayoti, naye Melayoti nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Amaliya, naye Amaliya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />naye Ahitubu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sadoki, naye Sadoki nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ahimaasi.<verse eid="1CH 6:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ja Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Aha ndo honhu howapegwe walelwa wa Aluni wa lukolo lwa Wakohati. Nawabochela honhu aho kwa vila nawali wa mwaluko kutowelwa simbi. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />Nawapegwa muji wa Hebuloni na honhu hake ha kudimila kuli isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Ila migunda hamwe na vijiji viwele naviuzunguluta muji awo nakapegwa Kalebu, mwana wa Yefune. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Lelo, walelwa wa Aluni nawapegwa miji aji hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. Nawapegwa Hebuloni, uwele ndo muji wa kubilimila na Libuna, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. Nawapegwa kahi Yatili na Eshitemoa, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />na Hileni na Debili, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />na Ashani na Beti-shemeshi, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Kulawa kuli honhu ha nhanzi ya Benjamini, nawapegwa miji ja Geba na Alemeti na Anatoti, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. Miji jeng'ha jowapegwe kwa kiwhana na ng'holo zawo, najali kumi na jidatu. <verse eid="1CH 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Walelwa wasigale wa Wakohati nawapegwa miji kumi kulawa kuli ng'holo za nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase.<verse eid="1CH 6:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Lukolo lwa Gelishoni kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo nawapegwa miji kumi na jidatu kulawa kuli nhanzi za Isakali na Asheli na Nafutali na Manase ako Bashani. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Walelwa wa Melali kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo nawapegwa miji kumi na mili kulawa kuli nhanzi za Lubeni na Gadi na Sebuluni. <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Ahyo Waisilaeli nawawapa Walawi miji aji hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Miji jilonjigwe aho hachanya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:65 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Miji jilonjigwe aho hachanya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miji ajo ndo jila jandichigwe kulawa kuli msitali wa makumi gahano na jine mbaka kuli msitali wa makumi sita (54-60).</char></note> kuli nhanzi za Yuda na Simeoni na Benjamini nawapegwa Walawi.<verse eid="1CH 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Ivyazi linji lya lukolo lwa Wakohati nalipegwa miji hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Lelo nawapegwa miji ja kubilimila, jiwele ndo Shekemu na honhu hake ha kudimila, kuli isi ya vidunda vya Efulaimu na Geseli, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />na Yokimeamu, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Beti-holoni, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />na Aiyaloni, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Gati-limoni, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />Kuli nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase nawapegwa miji ja Aneli, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Balaamu, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila.<verse eid="1CH 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />Walelwa wa Wagelishoni nawapegwa miji kota jino hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. Kuli isi ya nusu ya Manase nawapegwa Golani kuli Bashani, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Ashitaloti, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72" />Kuli isi ya nhanzi ya Isakali nawapegwa, Kedeshi hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Debelati, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73" />na Lamoti, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Anemu, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila.<verse eid="1CH 6:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74" />Kuli isi ya nhanzi ya Asheli nawapegwa Mashali, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Abidoni, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75" />na Hukoki, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Lehobu, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />Kuli isi ya nhanzi ya Nafutali nawapegwa Kedeshi kuli Galilaya, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Hamoni, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Kiliataimu, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila.<verse eid="1CH 6:76" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Walelwa wa Wamelali nawapegwa miji jino hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila hafungo mwa miji ajo. Kuli isi ya nhanzi ya Sebuluni, nawapegwa Limono, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Taboli, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78" />Kuli isi ya nhanzi ya Lubeni ubanzi wa kulilawilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, habehi na muji wa Yeliko, nawapegwa Beseli, muji uwele kuli ibalalika hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Yahasa, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79" />na Kedemoti, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Mefaati, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="1CH 6:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80" />Kuli isi ya nhanzi ya Gadi nawapegwa Lamoti kuli isi ya Gileadi, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Mahanaimu, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila <verse eid="1CH 6:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81" />na Heshiboni, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila na Yaseli, hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila.<verse eid="1CH 6:81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Walelwa wa Isakali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Isakali nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Tola na Pua na Yashubu na Shimuloni.<verse eid="1CH 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Tola nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Usi na Lefaya na Yelieli na Yahimayi na Ibusamu na Shemueli, wawele nawali ndo vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo. Mhela wa ulongozi wa mndewa Daudi, walelwa wa Tola nawali ndo wazidahe kitowa ngondo kuli lukolo lwawo na hisabu ya hewo nayali ndo wanhu elufu makumi meli na mbili na miya sita (22,600).<verse eid="1CH 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Usi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Isilahiya. Wana walume wa Isilahiya nawali ndo Mikaeli na Obadiya na Yoeli na Ishiya. Isilahiya na wanage nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Kwa kiwhana na lukolo lwa ivyazi lyawo, nakwali na walume elufu makumi gadatu na sita (36,000) wazidahe kitowa ngondo, kwa vila nawali na wache wenji na wana wenji.<verse eid="1CH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Ivyazi lya wanhu wawele nawali wazidahe kitowa ngondo kulawa kuli ng'holo zeng'ha za Isakali, kota vyowandichigwe kuli lukolo lwawo, hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu elufu makumi nane na saba (87,000).<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wa Benjamini na Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Benjamini nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Bela na Bekeli na Yediaeli.<verse eid="1CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Bela nayali na wana walume wahano wawele ndo Esiboni na Usi na Usieli na Yelemoti na Ili. Awo weng'ha nawali wazidahe kitowa ngondo na kahi vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo. Hisabu ya wamizi kuli lukolo lwawo nayali wanhu elufu makumi meli na mbili na makumi gadatu na wane (22,034).<verse eid="1CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Bekeli nayali na wana walume tisa wawele ndo Semila na Yoashi na Elieseli na Eliehonayi na Omuli na Yelemoti na Abiya na Anatoti na Alemeti. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Nawandichigwa kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo na ivyazi lyawo. Hisabu ya vilongozi wa hewo na wamizi nayali wanhu elufu makumi meli na miya mbili (20, 200), weng'ha wawele wazidahe kuli kitowa ngondo.<verse eid="1CH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Yediaeli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Bilihani. Bilihani nayali na wana walume saba wawele ndo Yeushi na Benjamini na Ehudi na Kenaana na Setani na Talishishi na Ahishahali. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Awa weng'ha nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi kuli ng'holo zawo na wamizi wazidahe kuli kitowa ngondo. Kulawa kuli walelwa wa hewo nakwali na wamizi elufu kumi na saba na miya mbili (17,200).<verse eid="1CH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Shupimu na Hupimu nawali walelwa wa Ili. Dani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Hushimu.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Nafutali nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Yaasieli na Guni na Yeseli na Shalumu. Awo nawali walelwa wa Biliha.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Manase nayali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Asilieli na Makili, kulawa kwa mhawake Mwalamu. Makili nayali mhaza wa Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makili nakawafika wache kwa Hupimu na Shupimu. Lumbulye Makili nayali yochemigwa Maaka. Mwana wa keli wa Makili nayali yochemigwa Selofehadi. Selofehadi nayali na wahinza hela.<verse eid="1CH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Maaka, mche wa Makili nakaponda wana walume weli, wawele ndo Peleshi na Sheleshi. Sheleshi nayali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Ulamu na Lakemu. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Ulamu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Bedani. Awa weng'ha ndo walelwa wa Gileadi, mwana wa Makili, mwana wa Manase.<verse eid="1CH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Hamoleketi, lumbulye Gileadi nakawaponda Ishihodi na Abieseli na Mahila. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Shemida nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Ahiani na Shekemu na Liki na Aniamu.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wa Efulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Efulaimu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shutela, naye Shutela nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Beledi, naye Beledi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Tahati, naye Tahati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eleada, naye Eleada nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Tahati, <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />naye Tahati nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sabadi, naye Sabadi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shutela. Efulaimu nayali na wana walume wanji, wawele ndo Eseli na Eleadi, wawele nawakopoligwa na wenyeng'haye wa isi ya Gati, kwa vila nawaluta ako kuwaboka migongolo jawo. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Efulaimu nakalombocheza kubagama kwa hewo kwa mazuwa menji ng'hatu na wang'holoze nawoya kumhembuliza. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Hamba Efulaimu nakawasa na mchewake, naye mchewake nakamponda mwana mlume yunji. Efulaimu nakamchema mwana ayo Beliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beliya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itagwa ali lyangiwhana na ulonzi wa Chiebulaniya uwele na mana ya itunyo ama mbuli yihile.</char></note>, kwa chiwalo cha mbuli yihile iwele nailawila kuli ivyazi lyake.<verse eid="1CH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Efulaimu nayali na mhinza yawele nayali yochemigwa Sheela. Ayu ndo yalajize miji ja Beti-holoni ya kuchanya na Beti-holoni ya hasi na Useni-sheela jizenjigwe.<verse eid="1CH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Efulaimu nayali na mwana mlume yunji kahi, yawele nayali yochemigwa Lefa. Lefa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Leshefu, naye Leshefu nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Tela, naye Tela nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Tahani, <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />naye Tahani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Ladani, naye Ladani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Amihudi, naye Amihudi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Elishama, <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />naye Elishama nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Nuni, naye Nuni nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yoshua.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Isi za hewo na haluga hawo nahali Beteli na vijiji vilinguuzunguluta muji awo mbaka ako Nalaani ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya na ako Geseli nawali ubanzi wa kolizinjilaga isanya, hamwe na vijiji vyake. Nawali wochikala kahi kuli miji ja Shekemu na vijiji vyake na Aya na vijiji vyake.<verse eid="1CH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Kuli mbaka wa isi ya Manase nawali Beti-sheani na vijiji vyake na Taanaki na vijiji vyake na Megido na vijiji vyake na Doli na vijiji vyake. Ajo ndo miji jiwele nawekala walelwa wa Yusufu, mwana wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelwa wa Asheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Asheli nayali na wana walume wane na mhinza. Wana walume nawali ndo Imuna na Ishiva na Ishivi na Beliya. Lumbulyawo nayali yochemigwa Sela. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Beliya nayali na wana walume weli wawele ndo Hebeli na Malikieli. Malikieli nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Bilisaiti. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Hebeli nayali na wana walume wadatu na mhinza. Wana walume nawali ndo Yafuleti na Shomeli na Hotamu. Lumbulyawo nayali yochemigwa Shuwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Yafuleti nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Pasaki na Bimuhali na Ashivati. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Wana wa Shomeli nawali ndo Ahi na Loga na Yehuba na Alamu. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Hotamu nayali na wana walume wane wawele ndo Sofa na Imuna na Sheleshi na Amali. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Sofa nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Sua na Halinefeli na Shuali na Beli na Imula <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />na Beseli na Hodu na Shama na Shilisha na Itilani na Beela.<verse eid="1CH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Yeseli nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Yefune na Pisipa na Ala.<verse eid="1CH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Ula nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Ala na Hanieli na Lisiya.<verse eid="1CH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Awo weng'ha nawali walelwa wa Asheli na nawali kahi vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo, wawele nawali ndo vilongozi walinguzeleka ng'hatu na wazidahe kitowa ngondo. Hisabu ya wala wawele nawandichigwa kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo, nawali elufu makumi meli na sita (26,000).<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Lulelo lwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Benjamini nayali na wana walume wahano wawele ndo Bela, yawele nayali ndo mlelwa wa heye wa mwaluko na wa keli nayali Ashibeli na wa kadatu nayali Ahala <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />na wa kane nayali Noha na wa kahano nayali Lafa.<verse eid="1CH 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Bela nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Adali na Gela na Abihudi <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />na Abishua na Naamani na Ahowa <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />na Gela na Shefufani na Hulamu.<verse eid="1CH 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6-7" />Walelwa wa Ehudi nawali ndo Naamani na Ahiya na Gela, wawele nawali ndo vilongozi wa ivyazi lya wala wawele nawali wochikala ako Geba, wawele kahi nawaholigwa na kuhilikwa kuli isi ya chijenzi ako Manahati. Gela nayali ndo mhaza wa Usa na Ahihudi. Gela ndo yawalongoze kuluta Manahati.<verse eid="1CH 8:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8-11" />Shahalaimu na mchewake Hushimu nawali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Abitubu na Elipaali. Hamba Shahalaimu nakamha kalatasi ya luleko mche wa heye Hushimu, kahi nakamha kalatasi ya luleko mche wa heye yunji yawele nayali yochemigwa Baala. Loyawele yochikala kuli isi ya Moabu, nakamhesa Hodeshi, naye Hodeshi nakampondela wana walume saba, wawele ndo Yobabu na Sibiya na Mesha na Malikamu na Yeusi na Sakiya na Milimahi. Awa weng'ha nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo.<verse eid="1CH 8:8-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Elipaali nayali na wana walume wadatu, wawele ndo Ebeli na Mishamu na Shemedi. Shemedi ndo yazenjile miji ja Ono na Lodi, hamwe na vijiji hafungo mwake.<verse eid="1CH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini wawele nawekala Gati na Aiyaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />Beliya na Shema nawali vilongozi hali wanhu wa ivyazi liwele nalyali lichikala kuli muji wa Aiyaloni na wawele nawawawinga wenyeng'haye wa Gati. <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Wana walume wa Beliya nawali ndo Ahio na Shashaki na Yelemoti <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />na Sebadiya na Aladi na Edeli <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />na Mikaeli na Ishipa na Yoha.<verse eid="1CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Wana wanji walume wa Elipaali nawali ndo Sebadiya na Meshulamu na Hisiki na Hebeli <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />na Ishimelayi na Isiliya na Yobabu.<verse eid="1CH 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Shimeyi nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Yakimu na Sikili na Sabidi <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />na Elienayi na Siletayi na Elieli <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />na Adaya na Belaya na Shimulati.<verse eid="1CH 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Shashaki nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Ishipani na Ebeli na Elieli <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />na Abudoni na Sikili na Hanani <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />na Hananiya na Elamu na Anitotiya <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />na Ifudeya na Penueli.<verse eid="1CH 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Yelohamu nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Shamushelayi na Shehaliya na Ataliya <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />na Yaaleshiya na Eliya na Sikili.<verse eid="1CH 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Awo weng'ha nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo kwa kiwhana na ng'holo zawo na nawali wochikala ako Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Yeieli nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Gibeoni. Mchewake nayali yochemigwa Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Yeieli nayali na wana walume. Mwana wa heye wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Abudoni. Wana wa heye wanji nawali ndo Suli na Kishi na Baali na Neli na Nadabu <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />na Gedoli na Ahiyo na Sekeli na Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />Mikiloti nayali ndo mhaza wa Shimeya. Awa kahi nawali wochikala habehi na ivyazi lyawo ako Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa mndewa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Neli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Kishi, naye Kishi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sauli. Sauli nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Yonatani na Maliki-shuwa na Abinadabu na Eshibaali. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Yonatani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Melibu-baali, naye Melibu-baali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mika.<verse eid="1CH 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Mika nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Pitoni na Meleki na Taleya na Ahasi. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Ahasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yehoada, naye Yehoada nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Alemeti na Asimaweti na Simuli. Simuli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mosa. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Mosa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Bineya, naye Bineya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Lafa, naye Lafa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eleasa, naye Eleasa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Aseli nayali na wana walume sita, wawele ndo Asilikamu na Bokelu na Ishimaeli na Shealiya na Obadiya na Hanani. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Esheki, mng'holoze Aseli nayali na wana walume wadatu. Mwana wa heye wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Ulamu na wa keli nayali yochemigwa Yeushi na wa kadatu nayali yochemigwa Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Wana walume wa Ulamu nawali wazidahe ng'hatu kuli kutumiya misale na mipinde. Nayali na wana wenji na wazukulu, hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu miya imwe na makumi gahano (150). Awo weng'ha nawali walelwa wa Benjamini.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wahiluche kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Ahyo, wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli nawandichigwa kuli lukolo na matagwa ago nagandichigwa kuli Chitabu cha Wandewa wa Isilaeli. Wanhu wa Yuda nawali wahilikwe kuli isi ya chijenzi ako Babuloni kwa vila nawadita gehile hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Wanhu wa mwaluko kuhiluka haluga hawo kuli muji wa hewo nawali Waisilaeli na watambika na Walawi na vitumagwa wa kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Wamwe wa wanhu wa nhanzi ya Yuda na Benjamini na Efulaimu na Manase nawaluta kikala kuli muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4-6" />Nakwali na wanhu miya sita na makumi tisa (690) kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda wawele nawekala ako Yelusalemu. Lulelo lwa mwana wa Yuda, yawele ndo Pelesi nalwali na chilongozi yawele ndo Utayi, mwana wa Amihudi, mwana wa Omuli. Wasekulu wake wanji ndo Imuli na Bani. Lukolo lwa Shela, kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda, nalwali na chilongozi yawele nayali yochemigwa Asaya, yawele kahi nayali ndo mwana wa mwaluko kuli ivyazi lya heye. Lulelo lwa mwana wa Yuda yawele nayali yochemigwa Sela, nalwali na chilongozi yawele nayali yochemigwa Yeueli.<verse eid="1CH 9:4-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7-8" />Wanhu walinguya wa nhanzi ya Benjamini wawele nawekala ako Yelusalemu, nawali ndo Salu, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Hodaviya, mwana wa Hasenuwa na Ibuneya, mwana wa Yelohamu na Ela, mwana wa Usi, mwana wa Mikili na Meshulamu, mwana wa Shefatiya, mwana wa Leueli, mwana wa Ibuniya.<verse eid="1CH 9:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />Nakwali na wanhu miya tisa na makumi gahano na sita (956). Wanhu weng'ha wawele nawandichigwa aho hachanya nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watambika wawele nawekala Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10-12" />Watambika wawele nawekala ako Yelusalemu nawali ndo Yedaya na Yehoyalibu na Yakini na Asaliya, mwana wa Hilikiya, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Sadoki, mwana wa Melayoti, mwana wa Ahitubu, yawele nayali chilongozi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na Adaya, mwana wa Yelohamu, mwana wa Pashuli, mwana wa Malikiya na Maasayi, mwana wa Adieli, mwana wa Yasela, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Meshilemiti, mwana wa Imeli. <verse eid="1CH 9:10-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />Watambika wawele nawali ndo vilongozi wa ivyazi lyawo nawali elufu imwe na miya saba na makumi sita (1,760). Nawali wawanzi wa chila mbuli ilingukoleka kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wawele nawekala Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14-16" />Walawi wawele nawekala ako Yelusalemu nawali ndo Shemaya na Bakibakali na Heleshi na Galali na Mataniya na Obadiya na Belekiya. Shemaya nayali mwana wa Hashubu, Hashubu nayali mwana wa Asilikamu, Asilikamu nayali mwana wa Hashabiya wa kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Melali. Mataniya nayali mwana wa Mika, Mika nayali mwana wa Sikili, Sikili nayali mwana wa Asafu. Obadiya nayali mwana wa Shemaya, Shemaya nayali mwana wa Galali, Galali nayali mwana wa Yedutuni. Belekiya nayali mwana wa Asa, Asa nayali mwana wa Elikana, wawele nawali wochikala kuli vijiji vya muji wa Netofahi.<verse eid="1CH 9:14-16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi wawele nawali wochikala Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Wamizi wa lwizi ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi wawele nawali wochikala ako Yelusalemu nawali ndo Shalumu na Akubu na Talimoni na Ahimani na wang'holozawo. Shalumu nayali ndo chilongozi wa hewo. <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />Wamizi awo nawali wokwamila kuli lwizi lwa mndewa luwele kuli ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya. Awo nawali wamizi kulawa kuli kambi ya Walawi.<verse eid="1CH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Shalumu, mwana wa Kole, mwana wa Ebiasafu, mwana wa Kola, hamwe na wang'holoze wa lukolo lwa Kola, nawali wokola mijito ja kwamila lwizi lwa ihema lyelile kota wasekulu wa hewo vyowawele wokwamila hali honhu ha kwinjilila ha ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Aho katali Finehasi, mwana wa Eleasali, nayali chilongozi wa wamizi, naye Mkulu Nguluwi nayali hamwe na heye.<verse eid="1CH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Sekaliya, mwana wa Meshelemiya, nayali mwamizi wa lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Hisabu ya wanhu wawele nawahaguligwa kuwa wamizi hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi nayali wanhu miya mbili na kumi na weli (212). Nawandichigwa kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo hali vijiji vyowawele nawali wochikala. Mndewa Daudi na mloli Samweli ndo wawawichile wamizi awo kuli mijito ja hewo ja kukundigwa. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Wanhu awo hamwe na walelwa wa hewo, nawali vilongozi wa wamizi wa kwamila lwizi ja ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Wamizi nawahilikwa kuli banzi zeng'ha, ziwele ndo kolilawilaga isanya na kolizinjilaga isanya na kasikazini na kusini. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Wang'holozawo kulawa kuli vijiji vya hewo nawali woluta chila mhela leka kuwatanza kukola mijito ja hewo, kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba. <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Nakwali na wamizi wakulu wane, wawele nawali ndo Walawi, nawapegwa mijito ja kulolela vihengo na ng'hano kuli ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Nawekala nechilo yeng'ha habehi na ihema lya Nguluwi kwa vila nawali na mijito ja kulyamila na kuchumula lwizi ja ihema alyo chila mitondo.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Walawi wamwenga nawali na mijito ja kulolela vinhu viwele navyali vikolelwa mijito kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Vinhu avyo navyali viwazigwa chila mhela wa kuhilikwa na kulavigwa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Wanji nawahaguligwa kukola mijito kwa chiwalo cha vinhu vya ng'handa ya Nguluwi na vinhu vyake vyelile vyeng'ha, hamwe na utimbo unojile na divai na mafuta ga mzeituni na ubani na unhunyhililo. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Ila mbuli ya kuwika goya unhunyhililo naiditigwa na watambika.<verse eid="1CH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Metitiya, yumwe wa Walawi, mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Shalumu, kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Kola, nakapegwa mijito ja kuteleka mibumunda ja nhambiko. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Walawi wanji kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Kohati, nawapegwa mijito ja kuteleka mibumunda ja honhu helile kuli chila zuwa lya Kwesela.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Wala wawele nawali wokwimba, wawele ndo vilongozi wa ivyazi lya Walawi, nawekala kuli vihengo vya ng'handa ya Nguluwi na hawaganigwe kupegwa mijito jinji kwa vila nawali wokola mijito jawo nemisi na nechilo. <verse eid="1CH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Wanhu weng'ha awo nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi kuli nhanzi ya Walawi, kwa kuwinza ng'holo zawo, wawele nawali wochikala Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasekulu na walelwa wa mndewa Sauli lwa keli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">8:29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Yeieli nayali ndo chaluchizo cha muji wa Gibeoni, muji uwele nayali yochikala heye hamwe na mchewake yawele nayali yochemigwa Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />Mlelwa wa heye wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Abudoni, walelwa wa heye wanji nawali ndo Suli na Kishi na Baali na Neli na Nadabu <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />na Gedoli na Ahiyo na Sekaliya na Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Mikiloti nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Shimeamu. Hewo kahi nawekala ako Yelusalemu habehi na wang'holozawo.<verse eid="1CH 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Neli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Kishi, naye Kishi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Sauli. Sauli nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Yonatani na Maliki-shuwa na Abinadabu na Eshibaali. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Yonatani nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Melibu-baali, naye Melibu-baali nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mika. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Mika nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Pitoni na Meleki na Taleya na Ahasi. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Ahasi nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Yalahi, naye Yalahi nayali na wana walume wawele ndo Alemeti na Asimaweti na Simuli, naye Simuli nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Mosa. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Mosa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Bineya, naye Bineya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Lefaya, naye Lefaya nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Eleasa, naye Eleasa nayali na mwana mlume yawele nayali yochemigwa Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Aseli nayali na wana walume sita, wawele ndo Asilikamu na Bokelu na Ishimaeli na Shealiya na Obadiya na Hanani.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa mndewa Sauli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Samweli 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Lelo Wafilisti nawetowa na Waisilaeli, nawo Waisilaeli nawabilima na wenji wa hewo nawakopoligwa kuli chidunda cha Gilibowa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Wafilisti nawawawinza Sauli na wanage, hamba nawawakopola wanage wawele ndo Yonatani na Abinadabu na Maliki-shuwa. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Ngondo nayali ing'hang'hale ng'hatu kwa ubanzi wa Sauli. Watowa misale lowamuwene Sauli nawamlumiza kwa misale. <verse eid="1CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Ahyo Sauli nakamlonjela munhu yalingupapa vinhu vya heye vya kitowela ngondo, “Uhole ipanga lya hegwe unyhome, leka wanhu awa wohambe wenjile ikumbi waleche kumbeza.” Ila ayo yalingupapa vinhu vya heye vya kitowela ngondo nakadumba ng'hatu na hawezile kudita ahyo. Lelo Sauli nakaliwika goya ipanga lya heye yuye na kuligwila. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Hamba yula yalingupapa vinhu vya heye vya kitowela ngondo loyamuwene Sauli nakabagama, naye kahi nakaligwila ipanga lyake, nakabagama. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Ahi ndo Sauli na wanage wadatu na ivyazi lya heye lyeng'ha, vyowabagame. <verse eid="1CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Waisilaeli weng'ha wawele nawali wochikala kuli ibindi lowawene kota wamizi nawabilima na kota Sauli na wanage nawabagama, nawajileka miji ja hewo na kubilima. Wafilisti nawaluta na kikala kuli miji ajo.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Zuwa lya keli, wala Wafilisti lowalutile kuvihola vinhu viwele kuli mitufi, nawajifika mitufi ja Sauli na wanage kuli chidunda cha Gilibowa. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Nawauvula nguwo mtufi wa Sauli na kuhola mutwi wa heye hamwe na vinhu vya heye vya kitowela ngondo, hamba nawawalajiza wasenga kuli isi yeng'ha ya Wafilisti kuwikula mbuli azo hali jimalukolo ja hewo na wanhu wa hewo. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Nawaviwika vinhu vya Sauli vya kitowela ngondo kuli ng'handa ya milungu ja hewo, hamba nawauniniza mutwi wa heye kuli ng'handa ya mlungu Dagoni. <verse eid="1CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Wenyeng'haye wa Yabeshi-gileadi lowahuliche Wafilisti vyowamditile Sauli, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />wazidahe kitowa ngondo wa hewo weng'ha nawaluta kujihola mitufi ja Sauli na wanage na kujihilika Yabeshi. Nawajitila mizeje jawo hasi ha igodi lilinguchemigwa mwaloni ako Yabeshi, nawo nawesela kulya kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />Sauli nakabagama kwa vila hawele wa kukundigwa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. Hauwinzile ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, mbaka nakalanda utanzi kwa mlaguzi kwa chiwalo cha ulongozi, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />honhu ha kumlanda utanzi Mkulu Nguluwi. Kwa chiwalo acho, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamkopola na undewa wa heye nakamha Daudi, mwana wa Yese.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kanguwa mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2 Samweli 5:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Hamba Waisilaeli weng'ha nawekungajiza hamwe kwa Daudi ako Hebuloni, nawamlonjela, “Ulole, hetwe ndo ivyazi lya Abulahamu. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Katali, mhela uwele Sauli loyawele mndewa, hegwe nakuwalongoza Waisilaeli kuli kitowa ngondo, naye Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe nakakulonjela, ‘Kowa mdimi wa wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli na kowa chilongozi wa hewo.’ ” <verse eid="1CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Ahyo wasekulu weng'ha wa Isilaeli nawaluta kwa mndewa ako Hebuloni, naye mndewa Daudi nakadita ilagano na hewo hali Mkulu Nguluwi, hamba wasekulu awo nawambakaliza mafuta Daudi leka yawe mndewa wa Waisilaeli, kwa kiwhana na ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi woyaulonjile kwa kukolela Samweli.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kanguihola Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Hamba Daudi na Waisilaeli weng'ha nawaluta Yelusalemu, muji uwele nawali uzeleka kwa itagwa lya Yebusi na Wayebusi nawali wochikala amo. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Wenyeng'haye wa Yebusi nawamlonjela Daudi, “Hukwinjila kuli muji awu.” Ila Daudi nakauhola muji awo na ngome ya Siyoni, iwele ndo muji wa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Daudi nakalonga, “Munhu yoneche yawele kowa wa mwaluko kuwatowa Wayebusi, kowa chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi.” Lelo, Yoabu, mwana wa Seluiya, nakawa wa mwaluko kuwatowa, ahyo nakawa chilongozi. <verse eid="1CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Daudi nakaidita ngome ayo kuwa ndo haluga hake, ahyo muji awo nauchemigwa Muji wa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Nakauzenga muji banzi zeng'ha, kwaluchila Milo mbaka kuli lukanzi kuizunguluta ngome, mhela wuwo Yoabu nakazenga honhu hanji hasigale ha Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Daudi nakalutilila kuwa na mong'ho ng'hatu kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nayali hamwe na heye.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matagwa ga wamizi wazidahe wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Samweli 23:8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Aga ndo matagwa ga vilongozi wa wamizi wazidahe wa Daudi, wawele hewo hamwe na Waisilaeli weng'ha, nawawimiza nzinzili undewa wa Daudi leka wenele kuli Isilaeli yeng'ha, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyalagane.<verse eid="1CH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Wamizi awo wazidahe wa Daudi ndo Yashobeamu, Mhakimoni, nayali mng'hangala wa wakulu wa wamizi. Heye naketowa kwa igoha lya heye na kuwakopola wanhu miya zidatu (300) kuli ngondo imwe. <verse eid="1CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Yazidahe yunji nayali Eleasali, mwana wa Dodo, Mwahohi. Yumwe wa wala wazidahe wadatu. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />Ayo Eleasali nayali hamwe na Daudi kula Pasi-damimu, mhela uwele Wafilisti nawali wekungajize kwa chiwalo cha kitowa ngondo. Ako nakwali na mgunda wa shayili nyinji ng'hatu, wamizi wa Waisilaeli nawawabilima wamizi wa Wafilisti. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Ila Daudi na Eleasali nawema nzinzili hagati ha mgunda wula leka kuulewela, nawawakopola Wafilisti. Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalohola kwa kuwapa kusumya kukulu.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Hamba wazidahe wadatu hali wala wakulu makumi gadatu, nawaluta kwa Daudi kunyenje, ako kuli mhalika ya Adulamu, mhela awo wamizi wa Wafilisti nawali wawichile kambi kuli ibindi lya Lefaimu. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Naye Daudi mhela awo nayali kuli ngome na wamizi wa Wafilisti nawali kuli muji wa Betelehemu. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Daudi nayali na ng'halu lukami, nakelonjela, “Ndangugana ng'hatu kunwa mazi ga kunwa kulawa kuli izimbo lya habehi na lwizi lwa Betelehemu!” <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Wala wazidahe wadatu nawafyela hagati ha kambi ya wamizi wa Wafilisti, nawaluta na kudeha mazi kuli ideho liwele habehi na lwizi lwa Betelehemu na kumigalila Daudi. Ila Daudi nakalema kunwa, nakagabohola hanyi kota nhambiko kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />yolonga, “Mbuli kota ayi ikole kutali na heni, siweza kuidita hali Nguluwi wa heni. Ndaze, nyinwe danda ya wanhu wawele nawawika ukomu wa hewo mmoko mwa wang'honyo kwa kigala mazi aga?” Kwa vila nawawika ukomu wa hewo mmoko mwa wang'honyo kwa kigala mazi, Daudi nakalema kunwa mazi gala. Ayo ndo mbuli iditigwe na wala wazidahe wadatu.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Abishayi, mdodowe Yoabu, nayali ndo chilongozi wa wamizi wazidahe makumi gadatu. Heye naketowa kwa igoha lya heye hali wanhu miya zidatu (300) nakawakopola, nakawa na lutogo lukami hali wala wazidahe wadatu. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Lelo, nayali na lutogo ng'hatu kusinda wala wazidahe makumi wadatu, mbaka nayali chilongozi wa hewo, ila hawele yumwe wa wala wazidahe Wadatu.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada, kulawa Kabuseeli, nayali mwamizi yazidahe, yawele nakadita mbuli nyinji za vinduzanduza. Nakawakopola wazidahe weli kulawa Moabu. Zuwa limwe mhela wa seluji nakadulika na kulikopola isimba kuli isimo. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Kahi nakamkopola Mmisili yawele nayali ng'wemang'wema kota mita mbili na nusu. Hanga Mmisili ayo nayali na igoha ikulu ng'hatu mmoko mwake kota igodi lya mtawa nguwo, Benaya nakaluta kwa Mmisili ayo yawele na nyhimbati hela, nakamsukula igoha alyo na kumkopola Mmisili ayo kwa igoha lya heye yuye. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada, nakadita mbuli azo na nakawa na lutogo kota wala wazidahe Wadatu. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Ahyo Benaya nayali na lutogo ng'hatu kusinda wala wazidahe makumi gadatu, hanga hawazigwe hamwe na wala wazidahe wadatu. Daudi nakamuwika yawe chilongozi wa wamizi wa kumwamila heye.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Wamizi wazidahe wa Daudi nawali ndo Asaheli, mdodowe Yoabu na Elihanani, mwana wa Dodo kulawa Betelehemu <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />na Shamoti, Mhaloli na Helesi, Mpeloni <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />na Ila, mwana wa Ikeshi kulawa Tekowa na Abieseli kulawa Anatoti <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />na Sibekayi, Mhushahi na Ilayi, Mwahohi <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />na Mahalayi, Mnetofahi na Heledi, mwana wa Baana, Mnetofahi <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />na Itayi, mwana wa Libayi kulawa Gibeya, wa nhanzi ya Benjamini na Benaya, Mpilatoni <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />na Hulayi kulawa kuli nzanda za Gaashi na Abieli, Mwalibati <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />na Asimaweti, Mbahalumu na Eliaba Mshaaliboni <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />na wana wa Hashemu, Mgiloni na Yonatani, mwana wa Shagee, Mhalali <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />na Ahiamu, mwana wa Sakali, Mhalali na Elifali, mwana wa Uli <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />na Hefeli, Mmekelati na Ahiya, Mpeloni <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />na Hesilo, Mkalimeli na Naalayi, mwana wa Esibayi <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />na Yoeli, mng'holoze Natani na Mibuhali, mwana wa Hagili <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />na Seleki, Mwamoni na Nahalayi, Mbeeloti yawele nayali yopapa vinhu vya kitowela ngondo vya Yoabu, mwana wa Seluiya <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />na Ila na Galebu wawele nawali Waitili <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />na Uliya, Mhiti na Sabadi, mwana wa Ahilayi <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />na Adina, mwana wa Shisa, Mlubeni, yawele nayali chilongozi wa Walubeni, yawele nayali hamwe na wanhu makumi gadatu <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />na Hanani, mwana wa Maaka na Yoshafati, Mmitini <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />na Usiya, Mwashitelati na wana wa Hotamu, Mwaloeli, wawele ndo Shama na Yeleli <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />na wana wa Shimuli, Mtisi, wawele ndo Yediaeli na Yoha <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />na Elieli, Mmahawi na Itima, Mmoabu na wana wa Elinaamu, wawele ndo Yelibayi na Yoshaviya <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />na Elieli na Obedi na Yaasieli, Mmesobayi.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Wamizi wazidahe wangilumba na Daudi ako Sikilagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Awa ndo wanhu wawele nawaluta kwa Daudi ako Sikilagi, mhela Daudi loyawele nakawinjigwa na Sauli, mwana wa Kishi. Wanhu awo nawali hali wala wazidahe wawele nawamtanza Daudi kuli ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Awo nawali wanhu wa nhanzi ya Benjamini kota vyoyawele Sauli. Nawali wazidahe ng'hatu kutumiya mipinde na misale na kutoza maganga kwa mhembeyo kwa moko geng'ha, gawele ndo wa kudilo ama wa kumoso. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Chilongozi wa hewo nayali Ahieseli yawele nakatanzigwa na Yoashi, awo weng'ha nawali wana wa Shemaa kulawa Gibeya. Wanji nawali ndo wana wa Asimaweti, wawele ndo Yesieli na Peleti. Wanji kahi ndo Belaka na Yehu, kulawa Anatoti <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />na Ishimaya, kulawa Gibeoni, yawele ndo yazidahe hali wala wamizi wazidahe makumi gadatu na kahi nayali ndo chilongozi wa hewo. Wanji nawali ndo Yelemiya na Yahasieli na Yohanani na Yosabadi, kulawa Gedela <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />na Elusayi na Yelemoti na Bealiya na Shemaliya na Shefatiya, kulawa Halufu <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />na wanhu kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Kola, wawele ndo Elikana na Ishiya na Asaleli na Yoeseli na Yashobeamu. <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />Wanji nawali ndo wana walume wa Yelohamu, kulawa Gedoli, wawele ndo Yoela na Sebadiya.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Wanhu wamwenga kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Gadi nawebagula na kilumba na Daudi kuli ngome ya heye ako kugunuche. Nawali wazidahe ng'hatu na wawele goya ng'hatu kwa ngondo na wazidahe kutumiya ngawo na igoha. Kumeho kwa hewo nakwali kwangukabusa kota kumeho kwa isimba na nawali wobilima kota ibala vyolilingubilima kuli chidunda. <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Chilongozi mkulu wa hewo nayali Eseli, wa keli nayali Obadiya na wa kadatu nayali Eliabu <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />na wa kane nayali Mishimana na wa kahano nayali Yelemiya <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />na wa sita nayali Atayi na wa saba nayali Elieli <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />na wa nane nayali Yohanani na wa tisa nayali Elisabadi <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />na wa kumi nayali Yelemiya na wa kumi na imwe nayali Makibanayi.<verse eid="1CH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Wagadi awo nawali wakulu wa chilundo cha wamizi. Kwa kiwhana na ukulu wa hewo kuli mijito, chilongozi wa hasi nayali yolongoza chilundo cha wamizi miya imwe (100) na chilongozi wa kuchanya nayali yolongoza wamizi elufu imwe (1,000). <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Awa ndo wanhu wawele nawaloka lwanda lwa Yolodani kuli mwezi wa mwaluko, mhela lwanda loluwele lumemile ng'hatu mazi na kuwambuza wanhu wawele nawali wochikala kuli mibindi wabilimile kuluta kolilawilaga isanya na kolizinjilaga isanya.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Wamwe wa wanhu kulawa kuli nhanzi za Benjamini na Yuda kahi nawaluta kuli ngome ya Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Daudi nakalawa mgati, nakaluta kuwabochela na kuwalonjela, “Wone namuya kwa heni kwa kikala goya kota goloko wa heni leka mnhanze, ndanguwabochela kwa nhumbula imwe, ila wone namuya kwa heni leka kumbelenhuka heni kwa kilumba na wang'honyo wa heni, hanga siditile chinhu choneche chihile, Nguluwi wa wahaza wa hetwe yawone na yawataguse.”<verse eid="1CH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Ahyo Muhe nakamwinjila Amasayi, mkulu wa awo wanhu makumi gadatu naye nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">“Hetwe ndo wanhu wa hegwe, gwa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">twa kuli ubanzi wa hegwe, gwa mwana wa Yese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">Utambichizo, utambichizo uwe kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">na kwa yoneche yawele kuli ubanzi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">kwa vila Nguluwi kokutanza.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 12:18">Hamba Daudi nakawabochela na kuwadita wawe vilongozi kuli vilundo vya wamizi wa heye.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Wanhu wamwenga kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Manase nawelumba na Daudi mhela loyalutile hamwe na Wafilisti kitowa na Sauli. Daudi na wanhu wa heye hawawatanzile Wafilisti, kwa vila vilongozi wa Wafilisti nawekundiza kumhilusa Daudi, nawalonga, “Towajiliza ukomu wa hetwe wone Daudi kotubelenhuka na kuhiluka kwa mkulu wa heye Sauli.” <verse eid="1CH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Lelo, Daudi loyawele Sikilagi, wanhu kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Manase, wawele ndo Adina na Yosabadi na Yediaeli na Mikaeli na Yosabadi na Elihu na Siletayi, nawaluta kwa heye. Chila yumwe wa wanhu awo nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha wanhu elufu imwe (1,000) kuli nhanzi ayo ya Manase. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Nawamtanza mndewa Daudi kitowa na vilundo vya wamizi walinguvaba, kwa vila weng'ha nawali wamizi wazidahe ng'hatu na vilongozi wa wakulu wa wamizi kuli chilundo cha wamizi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Chila zuwa wanhu nawaluta kilumba na Daudi, mbaka Daudi nakawa na chilundo chikulu ng'hatu cha wamizi kota chilundo cha wamizi wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilundo viyage vya wamizi wa Daudi ako Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Ayi ndo hisabu ya vilundo vya wamizi wawele na vinhu vya kitowela ngondo, wawele nawelumba na Daudi ako Hebuloni leka kuuhola undewa kulawa kwa Sauli, kwa kiwhana na ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Walume wa nhanzi ya Yuda wawele na migoha na ngawo nawali elufu sita na miya nane (6,800), weng'ha wawele wewichile goya kitowa ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Simeoni nawali wanhu elufu saba na miya imwe (7,100) wazidahe na wawele na uwanzi ng'hatu kuli kitowa ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Lawi nawali wanhu elufu zine na miya sita (4,600). <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Yehoyada, yawele nayali chilongozi wa ivyazi lya Aluni, nayali hamwe na wanhu elufu zidatu na miya saba (3,700) <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />na Sadoki, msongolo yazidahe kitowa ngondo, nayali hamwe na vilongozi wa wamizi makumi meli na weli kulawa kuli lukolo lwa mhaza wa heye yuye. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Benjamini, iwele ndo nhanzi ya Sauli, nawali wanhu elufu zidatu (3,000) wawele nawamuwinza Daudi, wenji wa hewo nawalutilila kitumbila kwa Sauli mbaka mhela awo. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Efulaimu nawali wanhu elufu makumi meli na miya nane (20,800) wawele kahi nawelumba na Daudi. Wanhu awo nawali wazidahe ng'hatu kitowa ngondo na walinguzeleka kuli ng'holo zawo. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Kulawa kuli nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase, nawali wanhu elufu kumi na nane (18,000), wawele nawachemigwa kwa matagwa leka walute kumdita Daudi yawe mndewa. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Isakali, vilongozi miya mbili (200) hamwe na wang'holozawo weng'ha wawele hali ulongozi wa hewo, nawo nawelumba na Daudi. Vilongozi awo nawali na uwanzi wa kuvizela mbuli za mihela na nawavizela chowalinguganigwa Waisilaeli kudita. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Sebuluni, wamizi wazidahe ng'hatu wawele na vinhu vya hewo vya kitowela ngondo na wewichile goya kuvitumiya, leka kumtanza Daudi kwa kukundigwa ng'hatu, nawali elufu makumi gahano (50,000). <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Nafutali, wakulu wa wamizi elufu imwe (1,000) hamwe na wanhu elufu makumi gadatu na saba (37,000) wawele na ngawo na migoha, nawelumba na Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Dani, wanhu elufu makumi meli na nane na miya sita (28,600) wewichile goya kitowa ngondo, nawo nawelumba na Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Asheli, wanhu elufu makumi gane (40,000) wazidahe kitowa ngondo, wawele nawawichigwa goya kwa chiwalo cha kitowa ngondo, nawo kahi nawelumba na Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Lubeni na Gadi na nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase ya kolilawilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, nawali wanhu lachi imwe na makumi meli (120,000) wawele na vinhu vya hewo vya kitowela ngondo, wawele nawelumba na Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Wamizi awo weng'ha, wawele nawewika goya ng'hatu kwa kitowa ngondo, nawaluta ako Hebuloni wawele na kunuwila kwa kumuwika Daudi yawe mndewa wa Isilaeli yeng'ha. Nawo wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli kahi nawelumba wawele na kunuwila kumwe kwa kumdita Daudi yawe mndewa. <verse eid="1CH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Lelo, nawekala na Daudi kwa mhela wa mazuwa gadatu, kuno wolya na kunwa kwa vila wang'holozawo nawawawichila vilyo. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Mzidi wa ago, walingikalasa habehi na hewo mbaka wala wa kutali kota ako Isakali na Sebuluni na Nafutali, nawawahilichila vilyo vipapigwe na midogowi na ngamiya na migongolo kota midogowi mikulu na misenga milume. Vilyo avyo navyali ndo utimbo na vilundo vya tini zikalile na vilundo vya zabibu zikalile na divai na mafuta na misenga na ming'holo minji. Ahyo nakwali na vilyo vinji ng'hatu, kwa vila nakwali na usangalalo kuli isi ya Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Isanduku lya ilagano lyanguhiluswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Samweli 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Daudi nakalongasa na vilongozi wa wamizi wa vilundo vya maelufu na vilundo vya mamiya, hamwe na vilongozi wanji weng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Hamba Daudi nakailonjela nhing'hano yeng'ha ya Waisilaeli, “Wone naiwa goya kwa hemwe na wone ndo kugana kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, tulajize usenga kwa wang'holozetu wanji wawele kutali na wawele habehi kuli isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli, kahi kwa watambika na Walawi wawele hamwe na hewo kuli miji jawo na kuli honhu ha hewo ha kudimila, leka woye welumbe na hetwe. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Hamba tulute kulihola isanduku lya ilagano lya Nguluwi wa hetwe, kwa vila natulibeza kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa mndewa Sauli.” <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Wanhu weng'ha nawaukunda ulonzi awo kwa vila nawoneka kota ndo mbuli inojile.<verse eid="1CH 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Ahyo, Daudi nakawakungajiza Waisilaeli weng'ha wa kuli isi, kulawa kuli lwanda lwa Shiholi luwele Misili mbaka Lebo-hamati leka kuligala isanduku lya ilagano kulawa Kiliati-yealimu. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Daudi na Waisilaeli weng'ha nawaluta mbaka kuli muji wa Baala, uwele ndo Kiliati-yealimu, kuli isi ya Yuda, leka kulihola isanduku lya ilagano, lilinguchemigwa kwa itagwa lyake Mkulu Nguluwi, yalingikalisa kuli chigoda cha heye cha undewa, hagati ha vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa. <verse eid="1CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Lelo nawalihola isanduku lya ilagano lya Nguluwi kulawa kuli ng'handa ya Abinadabu kwa mutuka unyale wa kukwejigwa na misenga. Usa na Ahio nawendesa mutuka awo. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Daudi na Waisilaeli weng'ha nawali womtogola Nguluwi kwa mong'ho wawo weng'ha, kwa nzimbo na kwa ving'hweleng'hwele na kwa igombogombo na kwa ngoma ndodo na kwa matoazi na kwa mhalamhanda.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Lowafichile kuli honhu ha kupululila nyhule ha Kidoni, Usa nakaugolola moko wa heye leka kulibatilila isanduku lya ilagano kwa vila jila misenga najikwang'hwala. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakazudizwa na Usa kwa chiwalo cha kibata isanduku lya ilagano, nakamkopola. Ahyo Usa nakabagama baho du hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Daudi nakazudila kwa vila ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi nayali ing'hang'hale kwa Usa. Lelo, kulawa mhela wula honhu aho nahachemigwa Pelesi-usa.<verse eid="1CH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Zuwa alyo Daudi nakamdumba Nguluwi, nakalonga, “Lelo ndoweza ndaze kulihilika isanduku lya ilagano habehi na ng'handa ya heni?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Lelo Daudi halihiliche isanduku lya ilagano kuli muji wa heye, ila nakalihilika kuli ng'handa ya Obedi-edomu, Mgiti. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Isanduku lya ilagano nalisigala na ivyazi lya Obedi-edomu, haluga ha heye kwa mhela wa myezi jidatu, naye Mkulu Nguluwi nakaitambichiza ng'handa ya Obedi-edomu na vinhu vyeng'ha vyoyawele navyo.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Daudi ako Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2 Samweli 5:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Hamba Hilamu, mndewa wa Tilo, nakalajiza wasenga kwa mndewa Daudi, kahi nakamhilichila migodi ja mielezi na wanhu walinguzenga kwa maganga na wanhu walingugongomanya vinhu vya mbawo, kwa chiwalo cha kuzenga ng'handa ya mndewa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Ahyo, Daudi nakavizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwimiza nzinzili leka yawe mndewa hali Isilaeli na kota undewa wa heye nauditigwa uwe ukulu ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli, wanhu wa heye.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Ako Yelusalemu, Daudi nakahesa wadala wanji, naye nakawa na wana wenji, walume na wadala. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Wana wawele nawapondigwa hala Yelusalemu nawali ndo Shamuwa na Shobabu na Natani na Solomoni <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />na Ibihali na Elishuwa na Elipeleti <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />na Noga na Nefegi na Yafiya <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />na Elishama na Beeliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kanguwasumya Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Samweli 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Wafilisti lowahuliche kota Daudi nakabakalizwa mafuta leka yawe mndewa wa isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli, weng'ha nawaluta na wamizi wa hewo weng'ha leka kumpala. Daudi loyahuliche mbuli ayo, naye nakaluta kitowa na hewo. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Wafilisti nawafika kuli ibindi lya Lefaimu na kwaluka kuwatowa wenyeng'haye wa hala na kuhola vinhu vya hewo. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Lelo Daudi nakamuuza Nguluwi, “Ndaze, ndute kuwatowa Wafilisti? Ndaze, kowawika mmoko mwangu?” Mkulu Nguluwi, nakamwidichila, “Ulute, kwa vila ndowawika mmoko mwako.”<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Ahyo Daudi hamwe na wanhu wa heye nawaluta mbaka Baali-pelasimu. Ako Daudi nakawasumya Wafilisti, hamba nakalonga, “Kota mazi tendema, Nguluwi nakawadumya wang'honyo wa heni kwa kukolela moko ga heni.” Ahyo, honhu aho nahachemigwa Baali-pelasimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baali-pelasimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ulonzi au una mana ya mkulu yalingutula.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Wafilisti nawabilima na kujileka jimalukolo ja milungu ja hewo. Lelo Daudi nakalajiza jilakazwe kwa chiluli.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Hamba Wafilisti nawaluta lwa keli kuwatowa wenyeng'haye wa ibindi lila. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Ahyo Daudi nakamuuza kahi Nguluwi, naye Nguluwi nakamwidichila, “Uleche kuwatowa kulawa hano, ila uwazungulute na kuwatowa kulawila kumwando mwa migodi ja mifolosadi. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Louhulika lizi lya wamizi walingujenda kwa magulu kuli vinhembenhembe vya migodi ajo, lelo ulute kuli ngondo, kwa vila heni Nguluwi nandikulongola leka kuwatowa wamizi wa Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Ahyo Daudi nakadita kota vyoyalajizwe na Nguluwi. Nakachitowa chilundo cha wamizi wa Wafilisti kulawa Gibeoni mbaka Geseli. <verse eid="1CH 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Lelo lutogo lwa Daudi nalwenela kuli chila isi, naye Mkulu Nguluwi nakawadita wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wamdumbe Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Isanduku lya ilagano lyanguhilikwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Daudi nakazenga ng'handa za heye kuli muji wa Yelusalemu, uwele kahi nawali uchemigwa muji wa Daudi. Hamba nakawika goya honhu na kuwika ihema kwa chiwalo cha kuwichila isanduku lya ilagano. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Hamba Daudi nakalonga, “Haduhu munhu yunji yoneche yawele kolipika isanduku lya ilagano ila Walawi, kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakawahagula hewo kulipika na kukola mijito hali heye mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="1CH 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Ahyo Daudi nakawakungajiza Waisilaeli weng'ha ako Yelusalemu, leka kulihilika isanduku lya ilagano hali honhu hawele nahagongomanyigwa kwa chiwalo cha isanduku alyo. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Hamba Daudi nakawachema hamwe walelwa wa Aluni na Walawi. <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Kohati, nakaluta Ulieli na wang'holoze miya imwe na makumi meli (120) wawele hali ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Melali, nakaluta Asaya na wang'holoze miya mbili na makumi meli (220) wawele hali ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Gelishoni, nakaluta Yoeli na wang'holoze miya imwe na makumi gadatu (130) wawele hali ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Elisafani, nakaluta Shemaya na wang'holoze miya mbili (200) wawele hali ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Hebuloni, nakaluta Elieli na wang'holoze makumi nane (80) wawele hali ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Usieli, nakaluta Aminadabu na wang'holoze miya imwe na kumi na weli (112) wawele hali ulongozi wa heye.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Daudi nakawachema watambika weli, wawele ndo Sadoki na Abiatali. Hamba nakawachema Walawi sita, wawele ndo Ulieli na Asaya na Yoeli na Shemaya na Elieli na Aminadabu, <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />nakawalonjela, “Hemwe ndo vilongozi wa ng'holo za Walawi. Miyelize hamwe na wang'holozenu leka mligale isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli mbaka hali honhu hondihagongomanye kwa chiwalo cha isanduku alyo. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Kwa vila hamlipichile hamwande, kwa chiwalo acho ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, naiwa kwa hetwe, kwa vila hatulihiliche kota vyoyalajize.”<verse eid="1CH 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Lelo, watambika na Walawi nawehovuga leka wakaligale isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Walawi nawalipika Isanduku lya ilagano mmayega mwawo wopichila mipichilo jake kota Musa navyoyalajize, kwa wula ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Daudi kahi nakalajiza wakulu wa Walawi wahagule wamwe wa wang'holozawo wawe wokwimba na kutowa vinhu vilingudita muzichi, kota vila ving'hweleng'hwele na matowazi, leka kulavya lizi likulu lya usangalalo. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Ahyo nawawahagula Hemani na wang'holoze, wawele ndo Asafu na Etani. Hemani nayali ndo mwana wa Yoeli na Asafu nayali mwana wa Belekiya. Etani nayali ndo mwana wa Kushaya, mlelwa wa Melali. <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />Hamba nawawahagula Walawi awa wawe watanzi wa hewo kwa kibata honhu ha keli, Sekaliya na Yaasieli na Shemilamoti na Yehieli na Uni na Eliabu na Benaya na Maaseya na Matitiya na Elifelehu na Mikineya na wamizi wa lwizi, Obedi-edomu na Yehieli. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Hemani na Asafu na Etani nawahaguligwa kutowa matowazi ga shaba. <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Sekaliya na Asieli na Shemilamoti na Yehieli na Uni na Eliabu na Maaseya na Benaya, nawali ndo walingutowa ving'hweleng'hwele kwa kiwhana na lizi lya Alamoti. <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />Ila Matitiya na Elifelehu na Mikineya na Obedi-edomu na Yehieli na Asasiya nawalongoza wawele na igombogombo kwa kiwhana na lizi lya Sheminiti.<verse eid="1CH 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Kenaniya, chilongozi wa Walawi, nakalongoza walingwimba kwa vila nayali yazidahe kuli mbuli ayo. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Belekiya na Elikana nawali wamizi wa isanduku lya ilagano. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Shebaniya na Yoshafati na Netaneli na Amasayi na Sekaliya na Benaya na Elieseli, nawali watambika, nawahaguligwa kutowa mhalamhanda kumwando mwa isanduku lya ilagano. Obedi-edomu na Yehiya nawahaguligwa kahi wawe wamizi wa isanduku.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Lelo Daudi na wasekulu wa Waisilaeli na vilongozi wa maelufu, nawaluta kulihola isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi kulawila haluga ha Obedi-edomu kwa kusangalala. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Nawamlavila nhambiko Nguluwi, misenga mibuguma saba na ming'holo milume saba na kwa vila nakawatanza wala Walawi wawele nawalipika lila isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Daudi nayali yavalile ikanzu lya kitani inojile, hihyo du Walawi weng'ha wawele nawalipika isanduku lya ilagano na walingwimba na chilongozi wa hewo Kenaniya. Kahi Daudi nayali yavalile chizibao cha kitani cha watambika. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Ahyo, Waisilaeli weng'ha nawekungajiza hamwe kwa luchenze kulipika isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi mbaka Yelusalemu. Nawalihilika kwa mhalamhanda na matowazi na lizi likulu lya igombogombo na ving'hweleng'hwele.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi loliwele likwinjila kuli muji wa Daudi, Mikali mhinza wa Sauli, nakasunjilila kuli itubuli na nakamona mndewa Daudi yovina na kusangalala, lelo nakambeza mnhumbula ya heye.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Hamba nawaliwika isanduku lya ilagano mgati mwa ihema liwele naliwichigwa goya na Daudi. Hamba nawalavya nhambiko za kulakazwa na nhambiko za kikala goya hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Daudi loyasindile kulavya nhambiko azo, nakawatambichiza wanhu kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />nakawagawila Waisilaeli weng'ha walume kwa wadala, chila yumwe nakapegwa ibumunda na chihande cha iwunde na chilundo cha zabibu zikalile.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />Kwa ago geng'ha, Daudi nakawahagula wamwe wa Walawi leka wawe vitumagwa hali Isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha kumlanda na kulonga malumbo na kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Nakamhagula Asafu leka yawe chilongozi wa hewo, yotanzigwa na Sekaliya. Yeieli na Shemilamoti na Yehieli na Matitiya na Eliabu na Benaya na Obedi-edomu na Yehieli nakawahagula wawe watowa ving'hweleng'hwele na igombogombo. Asafu nayali yotowa matowazi <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />na hewo watambika, wawele ndo Benaya na Yahalieli, nawahaguligwa wawe walingupemba mhalamhanda chila mhela hali isanduku lya Ilagano lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Lelo kuli zuwa lila, chinhu cha mwaluko chiwele Daudi nakaluka kudita ndo kumha Asafu na wayage lwimbo alu lwa lutogo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa lutogo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Zabuli 105:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">mliwikule itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">muwazelese wanhu wa isi zeng'ha madito ga heye goyaditile.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Mumwimbile heye, mumwimbile heye lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">msimile madito ga heye ga kububuwaza.<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Msangalale kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heye lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">nhumbula za walingumpala Mkulu Nguluwi zisangalale.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Mumpale Mkulu Nguluwi na mong'ho wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:11">mumhejelele Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12-13" />Hemwe walelwa wa Yakobo, vitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12-13">hemwe wana wa Isilaeli, wahaguligwe wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12-13">mkumbuchile madito ga heye ga kububuwaza goyaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12-13">vinduzanduza vya heye na nhaguso zoyazilavile.<verse eid="1CH 16:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Heye ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">nhaguso za heye nazenela muisi yeng'ha.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Mlikumbuchile ilagano lya heye mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:15">kangwenezaga kulagana kwa heye kwa lulelo elufu.<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />Kangubatililaga ilagano lyoyaliditile na Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">na ilagano lyoyamlahile Isaka.<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />Nakalitawiza kwa Yakobo kota ndo ilajizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">kwa Isilaeli liwe ndo ilagano lya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />Nakalonga, “Ndokupa isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">leka iwe uhalizi wa hegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Waisilaeli lowawele wachefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:19">wachefu na wajenzi kuli isi ya Kanaani,<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />nawalubaluba kulawa honhu hamwe mbaka hayage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">isi imwe mbaka yinji.<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Nguluwi hakundile munhu yoneche yawabunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:21">kwa chiwalo cha hewo nakawang'hanuchila wandewa,<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />yolonga, “Mleche kuwadoliza wabakalizwe mafuta wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">ne kuwalumiza waloli wa heni.”<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi, hemwe wanhu wa isi yeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">Chila zuwa mdamle madito ga heye ga ulohozi.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Muuwikule ukulu wa heye hali wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:24">muwalonjele wanhu weng'ha madito ga heye ga vinduzanduza.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mkulu, yalinguganigwa kutogoligwa kusinda weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">heye ndo wa kudumbigwa kusinda milungu jeng'ha.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Kwa vila milungu jeng'ha ja wanhu wa isi ndo jimalukolo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:26">ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakalumba ulanga.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Ukulu na lutogo vya hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:27">mong'ho na usangalalo vya hali honhu ha heye helile.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Mumhe Mkulu Nguluwi lutogo, hemwe ivyazi lya isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">ena, mumtogole kwa ukulu na mong'ho wa heye.<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Mumfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi kwa ukulu wa itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">migale nhambiko na mlute hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">mumfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi kuli welile ng'hatu wa heye.<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />Ukakame hali heye, hegwe isi yeng'ha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">Isi yeng'ha nayima nzinzili, haitigasika.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Usangalale hegwe ulanga, utowe luchenze hegwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">wanhu weng'ha muisi walonje, “Mkulu Nguluwi, kangulongoza.”<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Bahali ibogome na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele mumo vitowe iyowe lya kusangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">Migunda na vyeng'ha viwele amo visangalale.<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Hamba migodi ja kumhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">jokwimba kwa kusangalala hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">kwa vila kanguya kuitagusa isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />Mlonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa vila ka yanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:34">igano lya heye lya kwimilila lyangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Mumlilile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">“Gwa Nguluwi mlohozi wa hetwe, utulohole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">Utukungajize kahi na utulohole kulawa kuli wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">leka tulonje malumbo kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya hegwe lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha lutogo lwa hegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Yatogoligwe Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">kulawa mazuwa gose mbaka mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 16:36">Hamba Daudi loyasindile kulonga ahyo, wanhu weng'ha nawedichila, “Ena. Tumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufugamila ako Yelusalemu na Gibeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Ahyo, mndewa Daudi nakawawika Asafu na Walawi wanji hali isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi, leka wakole mijito ja isanduku chila mhela kwa kiwhana na mijito jilinguganigwa kuli chila zuwa. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />Nakawawika kahi Obedi-edomu, mwana wa Yedutuni, hamwe na wayage makumi sita na nane (68) leka wakole mijito hamwe na hewo. Obedi-edomu na Hosa nawali wamizi wa lwizi.<verse eid="1CH 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Mndewa Daudi nakawawika mtambika Sadoki hamwe na watambika wayage leka wawe vitumagwa wa ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi liwele nalyali hali honhu ha kufugamila ako Gibeoni, <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />leka kumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko za kulakazwa hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko za kulakazwa chila mhela, kuli mhela wa mitondo na matinazo, kwa kiwhana na malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi gawele nakawapa Waisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Wanhu wanji wawele nawakola mijito hamwe na hewo nawali Hemani na Yedutuni na wala weng'ha wawele nawahaguligwa na kuchemigwa matagwa gawo, leka kulonga malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vila igano lya heye lya kwimilila ndo lya mazuwa gose. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Hemani na Yedutuni nawali woganigwa kupemba mhalamhanda na kutowa matowazi na kutumiya vinhu vinji vya muzichi kwa chiwalo cha nzimbo za kumtogola Nguluwi. Wana wa Yedutuni nawali wamizi wa lwizi.<verse eid="1CH 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Hamba wanhu weng'ha nawoka, chila yumwe nakahiluka haluga ha heye, naye Daudi nakaluta haluga ha heye leka kulitambichiza ivyazi lyake.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Nguluwi kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Samweli 7:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Mndewa Daudi loyenjile kuli ng'handa ya heye ya chiundewa, nakamlonjela mloli Natani, “Ulole, heni ndangikala kuli ng'handa inojile izenjigwe na migodi ja mielezi, ila isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi lya mgati mwa ihema.” <verse eid="1CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Natani nakamwidichila mndewa Daudi, “Udite choneche choulingijesa mnhumbula mwa hegwe, kwa vila Nguluwi ka hamwe na hegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Ila nechilo yiyila ulonzi wa Nguluwi nawuya kwa Natani na kulonga, <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Ulute ukamlonjele chitumagwa wa heni Daudi kota Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino, ‘Huweza kunzenjela ng'handa ya kikala. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Kulawa mhela wula londiwalavile Waisilaeli kulawa Misili mbaka lehano, sikale kuli ng'handa. Nandali kuli majendo kuno ndichikala kuli ihema kulawa kuli honhu hamwenga mbaka hayage. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Hali chila honhu hondutile na Waisilaeli weng'ha, ndaze nandonga ulonzi woneche na vilongozi woneche wa Waisilaeli wawele nandiwalajiza wawadime wanhu wa heni kuno ndilonga, “Lekachoni hamnzenjele ng'handa ya migodi ja mielezi?” ’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />“Lelo mlonjele chitumagwa wa heni Daudi kota Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kangulonga hino, ‘Nandikulavya kula kuwele nawali udima ming'holo, leka uwe chilongozi wa wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />Kulawa mhela wula nandali hamwe na hegwe honhu honeche houlutile na nandiwakopola wang'honyo wa hegwe weng'ha hali hegwe. Lelo ndolidita itagwa lya hegwe lizeleche kota matagwa ga wanhu wanji wawele ndo wakulu ng'hatu muisi. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />Nani ndowapa wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli honhu ha kikala, leka wekale goya hali honhu ha hewo wawo, leka waleche kutunyigwa kahi. Wanhu wehile hawoweza kuwatunya kahi kota vyowaditile aho hamwande <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />na kota vyowaditile kuli mazuwa geng'ha kulawa londiwahagule watagusa kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli. Kahi ndowadumya wang'honyo wa hegwe weng'ha na mzidi wa ago ndangukulonjela kota ndokupa walelwa wenji. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Mhela wa kilumba na wasekulu wa hegwe houfika, ndomuwika yumwe wa wana wa hegwe yawe mndewa, nani ndowimiza nzinzili undewa wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Heye ndo yawele kozenga ng'handa kwa chiwalo cha heni, nani ndochidita chigoda cha heye cha undewa chiwe nzinzili mazuwa gose. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />Ndowa mhaza wa heye, naye kowa mwana wa heni. Nani sikusa igano lya heni lya kwimilila kwa heye, kota vyondilyusile kwa Sauli. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Mazuwa gose ndolwimiza nzinzili ludali lwa heye kuli ng'handa ya heni na kuli undewa wa heni. Ivyazi lya heye lyolongoza mazuwa gose.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Natani nakamlonjela mndewa Daudi ulonzi weng'ha woyagubuligwe.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Samweli 7:18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Hamba mndewa Daudi nakenjila mgati mwa ihema liwele nayali yaliwichile kwa chiwalo cha isanduku lya Ilagano na kikalisa hali Mkulu Nguluwi, nakaluka kulanda, “Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, heni na wang'holozangu twa whaani mbaka nakutuditila mbuli azi zinojile? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Mbuli ayi nayali ndodo hali hegwe, gwa Nguluwi, kahi nakulonga kuwala walelwa wa heni kuli mazuwa galinguya. Nakundola kota mkulu kusinda wanhu wenji, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />Ndikulonjele choni kahi mzidi wa ago? Hanga kwangunzela lukami, heni chitumagwa wa hegwe, ung'hali kwangunyinula. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha chitumagwa wa hegwe na kahi kwa chiwalo cha kunuwila kwa hegwe, nakudita mbuli ayi ng'hulu na kunzelesa kulagana ako kweng'ha kuwele kukulu ng'hatu. <verse eid="1CH 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, haduhu yawele kota hegwe na haduhu Nguluwi yunji ila hegwe, kota vyotuhuliche kwa makutu ga hetwe. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Kahi hana wanhu wachi kuli isi ayi wawele woweza kuwhanizwa na wanhu wa hegwe Waisilaeli, wawele waliyeka Nguluwi wa hewo nakaluta kuwagombola leka wawe wanhu wa heye? Nakizelesa kwa wanhu kwa kudita mbuli ng'hulu na zilingudumbiza louwawinjile wanhu wa isi zinji hali wanhu wa hegwe, wawele nakuwagombola kulawa kuli isi ya Misili. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakuwadita Waisilaeli wawe wanhu wa hegwe mazuwa gose, nagwe nakuwa Nguluwi wa hewo.<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mazuwa gose wimize nzinzili ulonzi wa hegwe woulonjile kuwala heni, chitumagwa wa hegwe na kuwala ivyazi lya heni. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Itagwa lyako lyotogoligwa mazuwa gose na wanhu wolonga, ‘Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, Nguluwi yawele mchanya mwa Isilaeli, ndo Nguluwi wa Waisilaeli.’ Ivyazi lya heni Daudi, chitumagwa wa hegwe, lokwima nzinzili hali hegwe. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />Gwa Nguluwi wa heni, nandali ndikangaza kukulanda kwa vila nakungubulila kota koludita lulelo lwa heni luwe lwa chiundewa. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe ndo Nguluwi! Nakulagana na heni chitumagwa wa hegwe mbuli ayi inojile. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Ahyo, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakuwatambichiza walelwa wa heni chitumagwa wa hegwe, leka walongoze mazuwa gose hali hegwe. Ena, kwa vila nakuwatambichiza na kwangulutilila kuwatambichiza mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Kusumya kwa wamizi wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Samweli 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Daudi nakawatowa na kuwasumya Wafilisti. Nakauhola muji wa Gati kulawa mmoko mwa Wafilisti. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />Nakawasumya kahi Wamoabu, nawo Wamoabu nawali vitumagwa wa heye na nawali womigalila kodi.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Daudi kahi nakamsumya Hadadeseli, mndewa wa Soba wa isi iwele habehi na muji wa Hamati, nakadita ahyo mhela Hadadeseli loyalutile kujeza kwimiza ludali lwa undewa wa heye kuli lwanda lwa Eyufulate. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Daudi nakahola mituka ja ngondo elufu imwe (1,000) na wamizi wakwina falasi elufu saba (7,000) na wamizi walingujenda kwa magulu elufu makumi meli (20,000). Daudi kahi nakawabagula falasi wa mituka miya imwe (100) kwa chiwalo cha heye, hamba nakawatema midanha ja magulu ga kumbele ja falasi weng'ha wa mituka wasigale.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Nawo Waalamu wa muji wa Damasiko lowalutile kumtanza Hadadeseli, mndewa wa Soba, Daudi nakawatowa na kuwakopola wamizi elufu makumi meli na mbili (22,000) hali hewo. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Hamba Daudi nakawika wamizi kuli undewa wa Waalamu kuli muji wa Damasiko. Lelo, Waalamu nawali vitumagwa wa mndewa Daudi, ahyo nawali womha kodi. Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha Daudi mong'ho wa kusumya kweng'ha koyalutile kitowa. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Kahi Daudi nakazihola ngawo za zahabu ziwele nazali za vilongozi wa wamizi wa Hadadeseli na kuzihilika Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Kahi Daudi nakahola shaba nyinji lukami kulawa kuli muji wa Tibuhati na kuli muji wa Kuni, miji jiwele najali ja Hadadeseli. Shaba ayo Solomoni nakaigongomanyila ibiga lya shaba na mizengo ja shaba na vinhu viyage vya shaba kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa ya Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Towu, mndewa wa Hamati loyahuliche kota Daudi nakawasumya wamizi weng'ha wa Hadadeseli, mndewa wa Soba, <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />nakamlajiza mwanage yalinguchemigwa Hadolamu kwa mndewa Daudi, leka yamlamse na kumtogola kwa kumsumya mndewa Hadadeseli kuli ngondo kwa vila Hadadeseli nayali yetowile ngondo na Towu mala nyinji. Hadolamu nakamhilichila Daudi vinhu vya zahabu na sendi na shaba. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Mndewa Daudi nakaviwika vinhu avyo viwe vya chiuyeng'ha kwa chiwalo cha kumfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi hamwe na sendi na zahabu ziwele nakazihola kulawa kuli isi za Edomu na Moabu na Amoni na Filistiya na Amaleki.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Abishayi, yawele mayake nayali yochemigwa Seluiya, nakawakopola Waedomu elufu kumi na nane (18,000) kuli Ibindi lya Mwino. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Lelo, nakawika kambi za wamizi ako Edomu. Waedomu weng'ha wa ako nawawa vitumagwa wa Daudi. Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha Daudi kusumya kweng'ha koyalutile.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Lelo, Daudi nakalongoza kuli Isilaeli yeng'ha, nakawaditila hachi wanhu wa heye weng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Yoabu, yawele mayake nayali yochemigwa Seluiya, nayali chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi na Yehoshafati, mwana wa Ahiludi, nayali yalingwandika kukumbuchila. <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Sadoki, mwana wa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki, mwana wa Abiatali nawali watambika, Shausha nayali yalingwandika <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />na Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada, nayali chilongozi wa Wakeleti na Wapeleti, nawo wana walume wa Daudi nawali wang'hangala kuli undewa wa Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kanguwasumya Waamoni na Waalamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Samweli 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Hamba Nahashi, mndewa wa Waamoni nakabagama, mwanage yalinguchemigwa Hanuni, nakalongoza honhu ha heye. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Lelo, Daudi nakalonga, “Ndomditila ganojile Hanuni, mwana wa Nahashi, kwa vila mhaza wa heye nakanditila igano lya kwimilila.” Hamba Daudi nakalajiza wasenga kumhembuliza Hanuni kwa chiwalo cha kubagama kwa mhaza wa heye. Nawo nawaluta kwa Hanuni leka kumhembuliza ako kuli isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Ila vilongozi wa Waamoni nawamuuza mndewa Hanuni, “Ndaze! Kwangijesa kota Daudi nakamtogola mhaza wa hegwe kwa kuwalajiza wasenga woye kukuhembuliza? Ndaze, wanhu awa hawoyile kuipugajiza isi leka waisumye?” <verse eid="1CH 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Lelo, Hanuni nakawebata wasenga awo wa Daudi na kuwabasa soni kwa kubeya lulevu lwa hewo na kuzidadula nguwo za hewo hagati ha madako, hamba nakawaleka walute. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Daudi loyalonjelwe vila vyowaditilwe wasenga wa heye, nakawalajiza wanhu leka kuwabochela kwa vila wasenga awo nawali wokona soni ng'hatu. Nakawalonjela, “Mikale kuli muji wa Yeliko mbaka lulevu lwa hemwe holukota ndo mhiluche kaye.”<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Waamoni lowavizele kota nawamzudiza mndewa Daudi, Hanuni na Waamoni nawahilika kilo elufu makumi gadatu na miya sita (30,600) za sendi leka wazichigwe mituka ja ngondo hamwe na walingwendesa mituka ajo ja kukwejigwa na falasi kulawa Mesopotamiya na Alamu-maaka na Soba. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Nawazichigwa mituka ja ngondo elufu makumi gadatu na mili (32,000) hamwe na walingwendesa mituka ajo. Mndewa wa Maaka na vilundo vya wamizi wa heye nawaluta kuwika kambi ya hewo habehi na muji wa Medeba. Nawo Waamoni nawekungajiza kulawa kuli miji ja hewo, nawewika goya kwa chiwalo cha kitowa ngondo.<verse eid="1CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Daudi loyahuliche mbuli azo, nakamlajiza Yoabu yalute na wamizi weng'ha wazidahe. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Mhela awo Waamoni nawalawa na kiwika goya hali lwizi lwa muji wa hewo, wandewa wanji wawele nawoya kuwatanza nawewika goya kwa kitowa ngondo na nawali waliyeka hali honhu hazelu.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Yoabu loyawene kota wang'honyo wa heye nawewika goya kwa ngondo kumbele na kumwando kwa heye, nakahagula wamwe wa wamizi wazidahe ng'hatu hali Waisilaeli, nakawawika goya kwa kitowa na Waalamu. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />Wala wamizi wanji wasigale, Yoabu nakawawika hali ulongozi wa Abishayi, mng'holoze, nawo nawawichigwa goya kwa chiwalo cha kitowa na Waamoni. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Yoabu nakamlonjela Abishayi, “Wone Waalamu wowa na mong'ho ng'hatu kusinda heni, lelo yokulapa uye kunhanza na wone Waamoni wowa na mong'ho kusinda hegwe, nani ndokuya kukutanza. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Uwe uzidahe! Titowe kwa kikangaza kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa hetwe na kwa chiwalo cha miji ja Nguluwi wa hetwe. Mkulu Nguluwi kotuditila linojile hali meho ga heye.”<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Lelo, Yoabu na wamizi wawele hali ulongozi wa heye nawaluta kumwando kitowa na Waalamu mbaka Waalamu nawabilima. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Waamoni lowawawene kota Waalamu wangubilima, nawo nawambilima Abishayi, mng'holoze Yoabu, nawenjila mgati mwa muji wa hewo. Ahyo Yoabu nakahiluka Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Waalamu lowawene kota nawasumigwa na Waisilaeli, nawawalajiza wasenga walute kuwegala Waalamu wanji wawele nawali kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Eyufulate wawele nawali wolongozwa na Shofaki, chilongozi wa wamizi wa Hadadeseli. <verse eid="1CH 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Daudi loyahuliche mbuli azo, nakawakungajiza Waisilaeli weng'ha na kuloka lwanda lwa Yolodani. Nakawawika wamizi wa heye kwa chiwalo cha kitowa ngondo na hewo. Daudi nakewika goya kitowa ngondo na Waalamu, nawo Waalamu nawetowa na heye. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Ila Waalamu nawawabilima Waisilaeli. Daudi nakawakopola Waalamu walingwendesa mituka ja ngondo elufu saba (7,000) na wamizi walingujenda kwa magulu elufu makumi gane (40,000). Kahi nakamkopola Shofaki, chilongozi wa wamizi wa hewo. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Vitumagwa wa Hadadeseli lowawene kota nawasumigwa na Waisilaeli, nawadita ilagano lya kikala goya na Daudi, nawo nawawa vitumagwa wa Daudi. Ahyo Waalamu nawalema kuwatanza kahi Waamoni.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kanguuhola muji wa Laba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Samweli 12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Kuli mwaluko wa mwaka, mhela uwele wandewa wangulutaga kitowa ngondo, Yoabu nakachilongoza chilundo cha wamizi. Nakaidumya isi ya Waamoni, kahi nakaluta kuli muji wa Laba na kuuzunguluta, ila Daudi nakasigala Yelusalemu. Yoabu nakautowa muji wa Laba na kuuleka uwele mahame. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Hamba Daudi nakaihola kofia kulawa kuli mutwi wa limalukolo lya mlungu wa hewo Milikomu, iwele nayali na itunyo lya kilo makumi gadatu na zine za zahabu na nayali izungulusilwe maganga ga sendi nyinji. Daudi nakawika libwe alyo lya sendi nyinji kuli kofia ya heye. Hamba wamizi wa Daudi nawahola vinhu viyage vya sendi nyinji. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Hamba Daudi nakawadita wanhu wa muji wula wakole mijito kwa lupichi kwa misumeno ja chuma na sululu za chuma na miwago ja chuma. Ahyo nakawaditila ahi wanhu wa miji jeng'ha ja Waamoni. Hamba Daudi na wanhu wa heye nawahiluka kuli muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitowa ngondo kwa Wafilisti ng'wemang'wema na Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2 Samweli 21:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Logakwete ago, nakulawila ngondo na Wafilisti ako Geseli. Sibekayi, kulawa kuli muji ulinguchemigwa Hushahi, nakamkopola Sipayi, yawele nayali yumwe wa Walefayi wawele ng'wemang'wema, ahyo Wafilisti nawasumigwa.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Nakwali na ngondo yinji kahi na Wafilisti. Elihanani, mwana wa Yaili, nakamkopola Lahimi, mng'holoze Goliati, Mgiti, yawele chaka cha igoha lya heye, nachali kota igodi lya yalingutawa nguwo.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Hamba nakwali kahi na ngondo ako Gati, kuwele nakwali na munhu yawele nayali ng'wemang'wema ng'hatu na yawele na vidole sita kuli chila moko na vidole sita kuli chila mgulu, vyeng'ha navyali vidole makumi meli na gane (24). Heye kahi nayali yumwe wa Walefayi. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Munhu ayo nakawaliga Waisilaeli, ahyo Yonatani, mwana wa Shimeya, mng'holoze Daudi, nakamkopola.<verse eid="1CH 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Awo nawali lulelo lwa Walefayi ako Gati, nawo nawakopoligwa na Daudi hamwe na vitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kanguwawaza wamizi wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Samweli 24:1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Limazoga nalyambuza magazo kwa Waisilaeli kwa kumhada Daudi yawawaze wanhu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Ahyo Daudi nakamlonjela Yoabu na wala vilongozi wanji wa wamizi, “Mlute mkawawaze Waisilaeli kulawa Beeli-sheba mbaka Dani, hamba mndonjele hisabu ya hewo.” <verse eid="1CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Yoabu nakalonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi yonjeze hisabu ya Waisilaeli mala miya kusinda vyowawele sambi! Mkulu wa heni mndewa, wanhu awa weng'ha hawawele vitumagwa wa hegwe? Lekachoni kwangugana kudita mbuli iwele yowagalila nongwa Waisilaeli?” <verse eid="1CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Ila mndewa hagalule majesa ga heye. Ahyo, Yoabu nakaluta chila honhu kuli isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli hamba nakahiluka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Hamba Yoabu nakamha Daudi hisabu ya wamizi. Kuli Isilaeli yeng'ha nakwali na wanhu milioni imwe na lachi imwe (1,100,000) wawele wadahile kutumiya mipanga na kuli Yuda nakwali na wanhu lachi zine na elufu makumi saba (470,000), wawele kahi wadahile kutumiya mipanga. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Ila Yoabu hawawazile Walawi na Wabenjamini kwa vila ilajizo wa mndewa naumzudiza ng'hatu.<verse eid="1CH 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Mbuli ayo haimnojeze Nguluwi, ahyo, nakawatowa Waisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Daudi nakamlonjela Nguluwi, “Nandita gehile ng'hatu kwa kudita mbuli ayi. Ahyo, ndangukudedeza wuse nongwa ya heni chitumagwa wa hegwe, kwa vila nandita mbuli ya chipoka ng'hatu.”<verse eid="1CH 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Gadi, mloli wa mndewa Daudi, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“Ulute ukamlonjele Daudi hino, ‘Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga ahi. Ndina mbuli zidatu kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, lelo wihagulile mbuli imwe, nani ndokuditila.’ ” <verse eid="1CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Ahyo Gadi nakaluta kwa Daudi na kumlonjela, “Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino, ‘Uhagule mbuli imwe hali azi. <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />Ndaze, lulawile lufemba lwa miyaka jidatu kuli isi ya hegwe ama myezi jidatu ja kuwabilima wang'honyo wa hegwe howokuwinza ama mazuwa gadatu ga utamwa wa tauni uwele Mkulu Nguluwi kougala kwa kukolela mhilisi, kuli isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli?’ Lelo, wamule ndaze vyondimwidichila ayo yandajize.” <verse eid="1CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Daudi nakamwidichila Gadi, “Nanyinjila kuli magazo makulu ng'hatu! Fola ngazigwe na Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa vila heye kana isungu ng'hatu, kusinda kugazigwa na wang'honyo.” <verse eid="1CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlajiza mhilisi yawegalile Waisilaeli utamwa wa tauni, uwele nauwakopola Waisilaeli elufu makumi saba (70,000). <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Mhilisi ayo loyagolole moko wa heye kulutila kuli muji wa Yelusalemu leka kuudumya, Mkulu Nguluwi nakagalula kunuwila kwa heye. Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela yula mhilisi yawele yowadumya wanhu, “Ihega! Uhiluse moko wa hegwe.” Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nayali yemile habehi na honhu ha kupululila nyhule ha Alauna, Myebusi. <verse eid="1CH 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Daudi nakenula meho ga heye, nakamona mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi yemile hagati ha kilanga na isi, yawele yagolole ipanga lya heye hali muji wa Yelusalemu, yawele goya kuudumya. Mhela awo Daudi na wasekulu weng'ha wawele nawali wavalile mivalo ja migunila kwa kulajila masinzo kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo, nawagwa chifunama. <verse eid="1CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Daudi nakalanda, “Gwa Nguluwi, heni ndo nditile gehile. Heni ndo ndajize kuwazigwa kwa wanhu. Wanhu awa ndo waliholile, hawaditile wihe. Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, magazo ago goye kwa heni na kuli ivyazi lya heni, ila uleche kukunda utamwa awu ulutilile kuwa hali wanhu wa hegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Hamba mhilisi ayo wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlajiza Gadi yamlonjele Daudi kota yalute kumzenjela Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kuli luga lwa kupululila nyhule lwa Alauna, Myebusi. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Lelo Daudi nakalihulichiza ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi, nakaluta ako kwa kuwinza ulonzi wa Nguluwi, woyaulonjile kwa kukolela Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Alauna na wanage walume wane nawali wopulula ngano, lowamonile yula mhilisi, wala wanage nawevisa, ila heye Alauna nakalutilila kupulula ngano. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Lelo Daudi loyawele habehi na Alauna, Alauna loyamonile Daudi, nakalawa kuli lula luga lwa kupululila nyhule, nakamfugamila Daudi na kinamiza kumeho kwa heye mbaka hasi. <verse eid="1CH 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Daudi nakamlonjela Alauna, “Nguzile honhu ha luga ha hegwe ha kupululila nyhule leka ndimzenjele Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, leka utamwa wa tauni uleche kuwafika wanhu. Ndohagula honhu aho kwa chasi cha kuhega.” <verse eid="1CH 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Alauna nakamlonjela Daudi, “Uhole luga alu mkulu wa heni mndewa na uhatumiye kota vyoulingugana. Ulole ndangujilavya mibuguma aji kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko za kulakazwa na vinhu vya kupululila nyhule kwa chiwalo cha ngodi, hamwe na ngano leka iwe nhambiko ya nyhule. Vyeng'ha avyo ndangukupa.” <verse eid="1CH 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Mndewa Daudi nakamwidichila Alauna, “Hebu! Ndangukomya, ndolipa kwa chasi cha kuhega. Sihola chinhu cha hegwe choneche kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi ne kulavya nhambiko ya kulakazwa iwele heni silavile chinhu choneche.” <verse eid="1CH 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Lelo Daudi nakamha Alauna migwala ja zahabu jiwele na kilo saba kwa chiwalo cha kuhagula honhu ha luga alo. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Hamba Daudi nakamzenjela Mkulu Nguluwi honhu ha kulavila nhambiko hali honhu aho na kumlavila nhambiko za kulakazwa na nhambiko za kikala goya. Nakamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi, naye nakedichila kulanda kwa heye kwa kigala chiluli kulawa kilanga leka kulakaza nhambiko.<verse eid="1CH 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlajiza mhilisi yahiluse ipanga lya heye, naye mhilisi nakahilusa lila ipanga myala yake. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Mhela awo, Daudi loyawene kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila kula kuli luga lwa kupululila nyhule lwa Alauna, Myebusi, nakalavya nhambiko ako. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi liwele Musa nakaligongomanya kula kugunuche, hamwe na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko za kulakazwa, mhela awo navyali hali honhu ha kufugamila ako Gibeoni. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Daudi hawezile kuluta ako kumlanda utanzi Nguluwi kwa vila nayali yolidumba ipanga lya yula mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Ahyo Daudi nakalonga, “Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi yowa honhu aha, hamwe na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko za kulakazwa kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwika goya kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja kuzenga ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Lelo Daudi nakalajiza wajenzi weng'ha wawele nawali wochikala kuli isi ya Isilaeli wakungajizwe, kulawa hali hewo nakawahagula walinguhongola maganga kwa chiwalo cha kugawika goya maganga ga kuzenjela ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Daudi nakalavya chuma ya kuhega kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila misumali ja mhajilo za lwizi ja ng'handa na shaba nyinji ng'hatu yohambe iwazigwe. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Kahi nakalavya mbawo nyinji ng'hatu za migodi ja mielezi, kwa vila wanhu wa kulawa Sidoni na Tilo nawamigalila Daudi mizinga minji ja migodi ja mielezi. <verse eid="1CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Daudi nakelonjela, “Mwana wa heni Solomoni yang'hali mdodo na kahela uwanzi. Ng'handa iwele yozenjigwa kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi yanguganigwa iwe inojile ng'hatu na ukulu na iwele yotogoligwa na wanhu wa isi zeng'ha. Ahyo ndangumuwichila goya vinhu avyo.” Daudi nakamuwichila goya vinhu vinji ng'hatu loyawele mkomu.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Hamba Daudi nakamchema Solomoni, mwanage, nakamlajiza yazenje ng'handa kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />Daudi nakamlonjela Solomoni, “Mwana wa heni, nanuwila kuzenga Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, kwa chiwalo cha kumfugamila. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Ila ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi naumbuyila na kundonjela, ‘Nakuwakopola wanhu wenji kwa kitowa ngondo nyinji, ahyo huweza kuzenga ng'handa kwa chiwalo cha heni, kwa vila nakubohola danda nyinji muisi hali heni. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Ila kowa na mwana mlume yawele kowa munhu wa kikala goya, nani ndomha kusindamala hali wang'honyo wa heye weng'ha kuli banzi zeng'ha. Itagwa lya heye lyowa Solomoni, nani ndowapa Waisilaeli kikala goya na kusindamala kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />Heye ndo yawele kozenga ng'handa kwa chiwalo cha heni. Kowa mwana wa heni, nani ndowa mhaza wa heye. Nani ndochimiza nzinzili chigoda cha heye cha undewa mazuwa gose hali isi ya Isilaeli.’<verse eid="1CH 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />“Lelo mwana wa heni, Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe, yawe hamwe na hegwe, leka usinde kuzenga ng'handa ya heye kota vyoyalonjile. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi yakupe luhala na nyhala, leka hoyokuwika uwe chilongozi kuli isi ya Isilaeli uweze kibatilila malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Kwa kudita ahyo mbuli za hegwe zolutilila goya, wone kochikangaza kuhulichiza mizilo na malajizo gawele Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha Musa kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli. Uwe uzidahe, uleche kudumba ne kutweguka nhumbula. <verse eid="1CH 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />Nandikangaza ng'hatu leka kupata vinhu kwa chiwalo cha Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. Ndanazo kilo milioni tatu na lachi zine (3,400,000) za zahabu na kilo milioni makumi gadatu na zine (34,000,000) za sendi na shaba nyinji ng'hatu na chuma nyinji ng'hatu, kahi ndanazo mbawo na maganga. Ila koweza konjeza. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Hegwe kuna wakola mijito wenji ng'hatu, wawele ndo walinguhongola maganga na walinguzenga na walingugongomanya vinhu vya mbawo, hamwe na wanhu wawele na uwanzi kuli chila mijito <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />ja kugongomanya vinhu vya zahabu na vya sendi na vya shaba na vya chuma. Lelo, waluche mijito aji, naye Mkulu Nguluwi yawe hamwe na hegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Lelo, Daudi nakawalajiza vilongozi weng'ha wa Isilaeli wamtanze Solomoni, mwanage, yolonga, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“Ndaze, Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe, hawele hamwe na hemwe? Ndaze, hawapele kikala goya kuli banzi zeng'ha? Nakawawika wenyeng'haye wa isi ayi mmoko mwa heni na sambi wa hali Mkulu Nguluwi na wanhu wa heye.” <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Lelo, mumkolele mijito Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe, kwa kunuwila na kwa nhumbula zeng'ha. Mwaluche kumzenjela Mkulu Nguluwi honhu helile leka isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi hamwe na vinhu vyelile vyeng'ha, viwichigwe mgati mwa ng'handa iwele yozenjigwa kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Daudi loyawele sekulu wa miyaka minji, nakamdita Solomoni, mwanage, yawe mndewa wa isi ya Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Mndewa Daudi nakawakungajiza vilongozi weng'ha wa isi ya Isilaeli na watambika na Walawi wanji. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Walawi weng'ha walume wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu na kulutilila, nawawazigwa. Hisabu ya hewo nayali elufu makumi gadatu na nane (38,000). <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />Hali hewo, Daudi nakawabagula Walawi elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000) leka wawe vilongozi wa wakola mijito ja Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi na wanhu elufu sita (6,000) wawe vilongozi wakulu na watagusa <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />na wanhu elufu zine (4,000) leka wawe wamizi wa hali lwizi na wanhu elufu zine (4,000) leka wawe walingwimba womtogola Mkulu Nguluwi kwa vinhu vya muzichi viwele navigongomanyigwa na mndewa Daudi kwa chiwalo acho.<verse eid="1CH 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Daudi nakawagawa Walawi kuli vilundo vidatu kwa kiwhana na ng'holo za nhanzi ya Lawi. Lukolo lwa Gelishoni na lukolo lwa Kohati na lukolo lwa Melali.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Gelishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Wana walume wa Gelishoni nawali weli, wawele ndo Ladani na Shimeyi. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Ladani nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Yehieli, yawele ndo wa mwaluko na Setamu na Yoeli. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Shimeyi nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Shelomoti na Hasieli na Halani. Awa wadatu nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi lya Ladani. <verse eid="1CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Shimeyi nayali na wana walume wanji wane, wawele ndo Yahati na Sina na Yeushi na Beliya. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Yahati nayali wa mwaluko hali hewo na Sina nayali wa keli, ila Yeushi na Beliya hawawele na wana wenji, ahyo nawawazigwa kota ivyazi limwe na nawapegwa mijito jimwe.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Kohati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Kohati nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Amulamu na Isihali na Hebuloni na Usieli. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Wana walume wa Amulamu nawali Aluni na Musa. Aluni nayali yawichigwe chiuyeng'ha leka yawe yoviwika chiuyeng'ha vinhu vyelile ng'hatu na walelwa wa heye wawe wofunyhiza ubani hali Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa gose, womkolela mijito na kuwatambichiza wanhu kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi, mazuwa gose. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Ila wana wa Musa, munhu wa Nguluwi, nawawazigwa kota ndo honhu ha nhanzi ya Lawi. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Wana walume wa Musa nawali Gelishomu na Elieseli. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Gelishomu nayali na wana walume, mwana wa heye wa mwaluko nayali Shebueli. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Lehabiya nayali ndo mwana wa udewele wa Elieseli, ila heye Lehabiya nayali na wana wenji lukami.<verse eid="1CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Mwana mlume wa mwaluko wa Isihali nayali yochemigwa Shelomiti, yawele nayali ndo chilongozi wa lukolo lweng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Hebuloni nayali na wana walume wane, wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Yeliya na wa keli nayali yochemigwa Amaliya na wa kadatu nayali yochemigwa Yahasieli na wa kane nayali yochemigwa Yekameamu. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Usieli nayali na wana walume weli, wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Mika na wa keli nayali yochemigwa Ishiya.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Melali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Melali nayali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Mahili na Mushi. Mahili nayali na wana walume weli, wawele ndo Eleasali na Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Eleasali nakabagama yalihela mwana mlume, ila nayali na wahinza hela. Wahinza awo nawaholeka na wang'holozawo, wana walume wa Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Mushi nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Mahili na Edeli na Yelemoti.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Awo nawali ndo wana wa Lawi kwa kiwhana na ng'holo zawo. Chila yumwe wa hewo yawele nayali na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi nakakola mijito kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Kwa vila Daudi nakalonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, nakawapa wanhu wa heye kikala goya, naye kochikala kuli muji wa Yelusalemu mazuwa gose. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Ahyo, Walawi hawalinguganigwa kahi kulipika ihema lya Nguluwi ne vinhu vyake.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Kwa kiwhana na malajizo ga kuduma ga Daudi, Walawi weng'ha wawele nawali na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi nawandichigwa. <verse eid="1CH 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Mijito jawo najali ndo kuwatanza watambika wa lukolo lwa Aluni kuli mijito ja kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi, mijito ajo ndo kulolela lugagala na vihengo na kuhovuga vinhu vyelile vyeng'ha na kukola mijito jinji ja kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />Nawali kahi na mijito ja kulolela mibumunda jelile na nhambiko za nyhule na mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso na mijito ja kubanika na kuhanzanya, hamwe na mijito jilinguwala vipimilo vyeng'ha vya winji na ukulu. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Kahi nawaganigwa kulonga malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kumtogola, chila mhela wa mitondo na matinazo <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />na mhela woneche wa kumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko za kulakazwa, kuli mazuwa ga Kwesela na kuli mnvina za kulawa kwa nyelezi na kuli mnvina zinji ziwichigwe. Nawaganigwa kukola mijito hali Mkulu Nguluwi chila mhela kwa hisabu ya hewo ilinguganigwa na kota vyowalajizwe. <verse eid="1CH 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Ahyo, Walawi nawali woganigwa kulilolela ihema lya Nguluwi na honhu helile na kuwatanza wang'holozawo watambika, wawele ndo walelwa wa Aluni, kwa chiwalo cha uchitumagwa wa kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Mijito ja watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Alu ndo lulelo lwa Aluni vyoluwele. Aluni nayali na wana walume wane, wawele ndo Nadabu na Abihu na Eleasali na Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />Nadabu na Abihu nawabagama mhela mhaza wa hewo loyawele yang'hali mkomu, hawawele na wana. Ahyo, Eleasali na itamali nawakola mijito ja utambika. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Mndewa Daudi nakawawika walelwa wa Aluni kuli vilundo kwa kiwhana na mijito ja hewo. Nakadita ahyo kwa kutanzigwa na Sadoki, mlelwa wa Eleasali na Ahimeleki, mlelwa wa Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Vilongozi wenji nawalawa hali walelwa wa Eleasali kusinda hali walelwa wa Itamali, nawo nawawichigwa kuli mijito kwa kiwhana kota ahi, vilongozi kumi na sita kulawa kuli ivyazi lya walelwa wa Eleasali na vilongozi nane kulawa kuli ivyazi lya walelwa wa Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Nawawichigwa kuli mijito kwa kutowelwa simbi, kwa vila nakwali na vilongozi wa honhu helile na vilongozi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi hali walelwa wa Eleasali na hali walelwa wa Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Yalingwandika Shemaya, mwana wa Netaneli, Mlawi, nakandika matagwa ga hewo hali mndewa na wakulu na mtambika Sadoki na Ahimeleki, mwana wa Abiatali na vilongozi wa ivyazi lya watambika na lya Walawi. Ivyazi limwe nalilawa kuli lulelo lwa Eleasali na ivyazi linji nalilawa kuli lulelo lwa Itamali.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Simbi ya mwaluko naimgwila Yehoialibu na simbi ya keli naimgwila Yedaya <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />na simbi ya kadatu naimgwila Halimu na simbi ya kane naimgwila Seolimu <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />na simbi ya kahano naimgwila Malikiya na simbi ya sita naimgwila Miyamini <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />na simbi ya saba naimgwila Hakosi na simbi ya nane naimgwila Abiya <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />na simbi ya tisa naimgwila Yeshua na simbi ya kumi naimgwila Shekaniya <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />na simbi ya kumi na imwe naimgwila Eliashibu na simbi ya kumi na mbili naimgwila Yakimu <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />na simbi ya kumi na kadatu naimgwila Hupa na simbi ya kumi na kane naimgwila Yeshebeabu <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />na simbi ya kumi na kahano naimgwila Biliga na simbi ya kumi na sita naimgwila Imeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />Simbi ya kumi na saba naimgwila Hesili na simbi ya kumi na nane naimgwila Hapisesi <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />na simbi ya kumi na tisa naimgwila Petahiya na simbi ya makumi meli naimgwila Yesekieli <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />na simbi ya makumi meli na imwe, naimgwila Yakini na simbi ya makumi meli na mbili naimgwila Gamuli. <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />Simbi ya makumi meli na zidatu naimgwila Delaya na simbi ya makumi meli na zine naimgwila Maasiya.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Awo weng'ha nawapegwa mijito ja hewo kuli Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kiwhana na malajizo gowapegwe na Aluni, sekulu wa hewo, kota Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, vyoyamlajize.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Awa nawali ndo walelwa wanji wa Lawi. Kulawa kuli lulelo lwa Amulamu, yumwe nayali yochemigwa Shubaeli na kulawa kuli lulelo lwa Shubaeli, yumwe nayali yochemigwa Yedeya. <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Yumwe wa walelwa wa Lehabiya nayali yochemigwa Ishia, yawele nayali chilongozi wa lukolo. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Kulawa kwa Waisihali, nayali Shelomoti na kulawa kwa Shelomoti, nayali Yahati. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Hebuloni nayali na wana walume wane, wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Yeliya na wa keli nayali yochemigwa Amaliya na wa kadatu nayali yochemigwa Yahasieli na wa kane nayali yochemigwa Yekameamu. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Kulawa kuli lulelo lwa Usieli, yumwe wa hewo nayali yochemigwa Mika na kulawa kuli lulelo lwa Mika, yumwe wa hewo nayali yochemigwa Shamili. <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Yumwe wa walelwa wa Ishiya, yawele ndo mng'holoze Mika, nayali yochemigwa Sekaliya. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Wana walume wa Melali nawali ndo Mahili na Mushi. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Yaasiya nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Shohamu na Sakuli na Ibuli. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28-29" />Mahili nayali ndo mhaza wa Eleasali na Kishi. Eleasali hawele na mwana, ila Kishi nayali ndo mhaza wa Yelameeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Mushi nayali na wana walume wadatu wawele ndo Mahili na Edeli na Yelimoti. Hewo ndo walelwa wa Lawi kota lukolo lwao vyoluwele. <verse eid="1CH 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />Hewo kahi nawatowa simbi kota vila wang'holozawo walelwa wa Aluni vyowaditile hali mndewa Daudi na Sadoki na Ahimeleki na hali vilongozi wa ivyazi lya watambika na lya Walawi. Ivyazi lya wakulu naliditilwa hihila kota ivyazi lya wadodo.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Walingwimba wa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Daudi hamwe na vilongozi wa wamizi, nawawabagula wamwe wa wana wa Asafu na wa Hemani na wa Yedutuni kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja kulavya uloli, wotumiya ving'hweleng'hwele na igombogombo na matowazi. Ilinguya ndo hisabu ya wanhu wawele nawakola mijito aji.<verse eid="1CH 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Kulawa kwa wana walume wa Asafu, nakwali na Sakuli na Yusufu na Netaniya na Asalela. Wana awo nawali hali ulongozi wa Asafu, yawele nakalavya uloli chila loyawele yolajizwa na mndewa. <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Kulawa kwa Yedutuni, nakwali na wana walume sita wawele ndo Gedaliya na Seli na Yeshaya na Shimeyi na Hashabiya na Matitiya. Nawo kahi nawali hali ulongozi wa mhaza wa hewo, yawele ndo Yedutuni. Nayali yolavya uloli yotumiya ching'weleng'wele, yomtogola na kulonga malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="1CH 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Kulawa kwa Hemani, nakwali na wana walume, wawele ndo Bukiya na Mataniya na Usieli na Shebueli na Yelimoti na Hananiya na Hanani na Eliata na Gidaliti na Lomamuti-eseli na Yoshibekasa na Maloti na Hotili na Mahasioti. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Awa weng'ha nawali wana wa Hemani mloli wa mndewa. Nakawapata wana awa kwa kiwhana na ilagano lya Nguluwi, leka Nguluwi yamwinule Hemani. Nguluwi nakamha Hemani wana walume kumi na wane na wahinza wadatu. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Wana weng'ha awa walume nawali hali ulongozi wa mhaza wa hewo, yawele ndo Hemani, kwa chiwalo cha kwimba kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi wotumiya matowazi na igombogombo na ving'hweleng'hwele, kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Asafu na Yedutuni na Hemani nawali hali ulongozi wa mndewa. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Hisabu ya hewo hamwe na wala wang'holozawo wawele nawalangusigwa kumwimbila Mkulu Nguluwi, weng'ha nawali wazidahe ng'hatu kwimba, nawali wanhu miya mbili na makumi nane na nane (288). <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Wasongolo na wasekulu na walangusa na walanguswa, weng'ha nawewika kuli mijito ja hewo kwa simbi.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Simbi ya mwaluko naimgwila Yusufu yawele ndo mlelwa wa Asafu, hamwe na wang'holoze na wanage kumi na weli. Simbi ya keli naimgwila Gedaliya, hamwe na wang'holoze na wanage kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />na simbi ya kadatu naimgwila Sakuli, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />na simbi ya kane naimgwila Seli, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />na simbi ya kahano naimgwila Netaniya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />na simbi ya sita naimgwila Bukiya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />na simbi ya saba naimgwila Asalela, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />na simbi ya nane naimgwila Yeshaya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />na simbi ya tisa naimgwila Mataniya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />na simbi ya kumi naimgwila Shimeyi, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />na simbi ya kumi na imwe naimgwila Asaleli, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />na simbi ya kumi na mbili naimgwila Hashabiya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />na simbi ya kumi na kadatu naimgwila Shubaeli, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />na simbi ya kumi na zine naimgwila Matitiya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />na simbi ya kumi na kahano naimgwila Yelemoti, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />na simbi ya kumi na sita naimgwila Hananiya, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />na simbi ya kumi na saba naimgwila Yoshibekasa, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />na simbi ya kumi na nane naimgwila Hanani, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />na simbi ya kumi na tisa naimgwila Maloti, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />na simbi ya makumi meli naimgwila Eliata, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />na simbi ya makumi meli na imwe naimgwila Hotili, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />na simbi ya makumi meli na mbili naimgwila Gidaliti, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />na simbi ya makumi meli na zidatu naimgwila Mahasioti, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />na simbi ya makumi meli na zine naimgwila Lomamuti-eseli, hamwe na wanage na wang'holoze kumi na weli.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Wamizi wa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Avi ndo vilundo vya Walawi viwele navikola mijito ja kwamila. Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Kola, nayali Meshelemiya mwana wa Kole wa ivyazi lya Asafu. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Heye Meshelemiya nayali na wana walume saba, wa mwaluko nayali Sekaliya na wa keli nayali Yediaeli na wa kadatu nayali Sebadiya na wa kane nayali Yasineli <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />na wa kahano nayali Elamu na wa sita nayali Yohanani na wa saba nayali Eliehoenayi.<verse eid="1CH 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4-5" />Kahi nakwali na Obedi-edomu, yawele Nguluwi nakamtambichiza kwa kumha wana nane, wa mwaluko nayali Shemaya na wa keli nayali Yehosabadi na wa kadatu nayali Yowa na wa kane nayali Sakali na wa kahano nayali Netaneli na wa sita nayali Amieli na wa saba nayali Isakali na wa nane nayali Peuletayi. <verse eid="1CH 26:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Shemaya, mwana wa Obedi-edomu nayali na wana walume wawele nawali vilongozi kuli ivyazi lya mhaza wa hewo, kwa vila nawali wazidahe ng'hatu. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Wana awo nawali ndo Otini na Lefaeli na Obedi na Elisabadi. Wang'holoze Shemaya wawele nawali wazidahe ng'hatu nawali ndo Elihu na Semakiya. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Awo weng'ha nawali ndo walelwa wa Obedi-edomu, hewo na wana wa hewo na ivyazi lyawo nawali wanhu wazidahe na wawele na mong'ho wa kukola mijito. Lulelo lwa Obedi-edomu nalwali wanhu makumi sita na weli. <verse eid="1CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Naye Meshelemiya nayali na wana na wang'holoze, wawele nawali wazidahe. Hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu kumi na nane.<verse eid="1CH 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Hosa, yumwe wa wana wa Melali nayali na wana wane, wawele ndo Shimuli yawele nakawichigwa na mhaza wa heye leka yawe chilongozi, hanga hawele mlelwa wa mwaluko <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />na Hilikiya na Tebaliya na Sekaliya. Hisabu ya wana weng'ha wa Hosa hamwe na wang'holoze nawali wanhu kumi na wadatu.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Wamizi awo nawagawanulwa kuli vilundo kwa kiwhana na ivyazi lyawo, nawo kahi nawapegwa mijito ja kwamila lwizi lwa ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi kota wala Walawi wanji. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Chila ivyazi ne kulola winji wa hewo, nalitowelwa simbi kuhagula lwizi lwa kulolela. <verse eid="1CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Simbi ya kumhagula munhu wa kwamila lwizi lwa kolilawilaga isanya naimgwila Shelemiya. Nawatowa simbi kahi kwa chiwalo cha mwanage yalinguchemigwa Sekaliya, yawele nayali yalingulonga ulonzi uwele na luhala, naye naimgwila simbi ya kwamila lwizi lwa kasikazini. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Simbi ya kwamila lwizi lwa kusini naimgwila Obedi-edomu, nayo simbi ya kwamila ng'hano naiwagwila wanage. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Simbi za kwamila lwizi ja kolizinjilaga isanya na lwizi lwa Shaleketi kuli nzila ya kuchanya naziwagwila Shupimu na Hosa. Wamizi nawakola mijito kwa kiwalila. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Chila zuwa kuli ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya nakwali na wamizi sita na kasikazini nakwali na wamizi wane na kusini nakwali na wamizi wane, kahi kuli ng'hano nakuwichigwa wamizi weli <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />na kuli chibumuli cha kulutila kolizinjilaga isanya, nakwali na wamizi wane mnzila na wamizi weli kuli chibumuli acho. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Avi ndo vilundo vya wamizi hali lukolo lwa Kola na walelwa wa Melali wawele nawakola mijito ja kwamila.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakola mijito wa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Hali Walawi, Ahiya nayali na mijito ja kulolela ng'hano za ng'handa ya Nguluwi na ng'hano za vinhu viwichigwe chiuyeng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Ladani, nakalawa kuli lukolo lwa Gelishoni na nayali mhaza wa Yehieli. Walelwa wanji wa heye nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi kuli lukolo. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Wana wa Yehieli, nawali ndo Setamu na Yoeli, nawali walingulolela ng'hano ya ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Mijito aji kahi nawapegwa walelwa wa Amulamu na walelwa wa Isihali na walelwa wa Hebuloni na walelwa wa Usieli.<verse eid="1CH 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Shebueli, mlelwa wa Gelishomu, mwana wa Musa, nayali chilongozi mkulu wa ng'hano. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Walelwa wa Elieseli, yawele ndo mng'holoze Gelishomu, nawali ndo Lehabiya na Yolamu na Sikili na Shelomoti. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Shelomoti na ivyazi lya heye nawali wololela ng'hano zeng'ha za vinhu viwele naviwichigwa chiuyeng'ha na mndewa Daudi kwa vilongozi wa ivyazi liwele nalyali ndo wakulu wa wamizi maelufu na mamiya na kwa vilongozi wakulu wanji wa wamizi. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Vinhu vimwenga viwele naviholigwa kulawa kuli ngondo nawaviwika chiuyeng'ha kwa chiwalo cha kuzenga kahi ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Chila chinhu chiwele nachiwichigwa chiuyeng'ha na Samweli, mloli na Sauli, mwana wa Kishi na Abuneli, mwana wa Neli na Yoabu, yawele mayake nayali yochemigwa Seluiya, hamwe na vinhu viyage vyeng'ha viwele naviwichigwa chiuyeng'ha, vyeng'ha navyali hali ulolezi wa Shelomoti na ivyazi lya heye.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Walawi wanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Kulawa kwa walelwa wa Isihali, Kenaniya na wanage nawapegwa mijito ja kulongoza kota wang'hangala na watagusa hali Waisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Hali Wahebuloni, Hashabiya na wang'holoze elufu imwe na miya saba (1,700), weng'ha wawele wazidahe, nawapegwa mijito ja kwimilila honhu ha Isilaeli ha ubanzi wa kolizinjilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani. Nawemilila mijito jeng'ha ja Mkulu Nguluwi na ja mndewa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Hali Wahebuloni, Yeliya nayali chilongozi wa lukolo na ivyazi lyeng'ha. Kuli mwaka wa makumi gane wa ulongozi wa mndewa Daudi, nakwali na kupugajiza, nawoneka Wahebuloni wazidahe ng'hatu kula Yaseli, ako Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Mndewa Daudi nakamhagula Yeliya na wang'holoze elufu mbili na miya saba (2,700) wawele wazidahe na vilongozi wa ng'holo, leka kwimilila mbuli zeng'ha zilingumuwala heye na Nguluwi, kuli nhanzi za Lubeni na Gadi na nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase, ziwele nazali kuli ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Mijito ja wamizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Aga ndo matagwa ga Waisilaeli, wawele nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi na vilongozi wa wakulu wa wamizi maelufu na mamiya na wang'hangala wawo, wawele nawamkolela mijito mndewa Daudi kwa mbuli zilinguwala vilundo vya wamizi viwele navyali kuli kuwalila chila mwezi kuli mwaka weng'ha. Chila chilundo nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000).<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Yashobeamu, mwana wa Sabudieli, nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa mwaluko. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Heye nayali mlelwa wa Pelesi, naye nayali chilongozi wa wang'hangala wa wamizi weng'ha kuli chila mwezi wa mwaluko wa mwaka. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa keli nayali Dodayi, Mwahohi. Mikiloti ndo yawele nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha heye. Chilundo acho nachali na wamizi elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Chilongozi wa wakulu wa wamizi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa kadatu nayali Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada, mtambika mkulu. Heye nayali mkulu wa chilundo chiwele na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Ayu ndo Benaya yawele nayali yazidahe hali chilundo cha wanhu makumi gadatu na nayali chilongozi wa chilundo acho. Amisabadi, mwana wa Benaya, nayali hali chilundo acho. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa kane nayali Asaheli, mng'holoze Yoabu. Mwana wa Asaheli yalinguchemigwa Sebadiya nakahola honhu ha heye ha ulongozi. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Chilongozi wa chilundo kuli mwezi wa kahano nayali Shamuhuti, Mwisilahi. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa sita nayali Ila, mwana wa Ikeshi, Mtekowa. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa saba nayali Helesi, Mpeloni wa lulelo lwa Efulaimu. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa nane nayali Sibekayi, Mhushahi wa lulelo lwa Sela. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa tisa nayali Abieseli, Mwanatoti wa lulelo lwa Benjamini. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa kumi nayali Mahalayi, Mnetofahi wa lulelo lwa Sela. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha kumi na imwe nayali Benaya, Mpilatoni wa lulelo lwa Efulaimu. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000). <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Chilongozi wa chilundo cha mwezi wa kumi na mbili nayali Helidayi, Mnetofahi wa lulelo lwa Otinieli. Chilundo cha heye nachali na wanhu elufu makumi meli na zine (24,000).<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongozi wa kuli nhanzi za Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Aga ndo matagwa ga vilongozi wakulu wa nhanzi za Isilaeli. Kwa Walubeni nayali Elieseli, mwana wa Sikili na kwa Wasimeoni nayali Shefatiya, mwana wa Maaka <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />na kwa Walawi nayali Hashabiya, mwana wa Kemueli na kwa Aluni nayali Sadoki. <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />Kwa Wayuda nayali Elihu, mng'holoze mndewa Daudi na kwa Waisakali nayali Omali, mwana wa Mikaeli <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />na kwa Wasebuluni nayali Ishimaya, mwana wa Obadiya na kwa Wanafutali nayali Yelemoti, mwana wa Asilieli <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />na kwa Waefulaimu nayali Hoseya, mwana wa Asasiya na kwa nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase nayali Yoeli, mwana wa Pedaya <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />na kwa nusu iyage ya nhanzi ya Manase ya Gileadi nayali Ido, mwana wa Sekaliya na kwa Wabenjamini nayali Yaasieli, mwana wa Abuneli <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />na kwa Wadani nayali Asaleli, mwana wa Yelohamu. Awo nawali ndo vilongozi wakulu wa nhanzi za Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Mndewa Daudi hawawazile wala wawele hasi ha miyaka makumi meli, kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakelaha kuwadita Waisilaeli wawe wenji kota nhondwe za kilanga. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Yoabu, yawele mayake nayali yochemigwa Seluiya nakaluka kuwawaza ila hasindile. Ng'halazi ya Nguluwi naiwafika Waisilaeli kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayo na hisabu ya hewo hayandichigwe kuli chitabu cha kukumbuchila kwa mndewa Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walingulolela lufufu lwa chiundewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Asimaweti, mwana wa Adieli ndo nayali yololela ng'hano za mndewa Daudi. Munhu yawele nayali yololela ng'hano za kuli migunda na miji na vijiji na kuli ngome nayali Yonatani, mwana wa Usiya. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Esili, mwana wa Kelubu, nayali chilongozi wa walingukola mijito ja kulima kuli migunda. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Shimeyi, Mlamati, nayali chilongozi wa kuli migunda ja zabibu. Sabudi, Mshifumi, nayali chilongozi wa kuli mijito ja zabibu na kugongomanya na kulolela divai kuli midalamu mikulu. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Baali-hanani, Mgedeli ndo nayali yololela migunda ja mndewa ja mizeituni na mikuyu kuli vidunda vya kolizinjilaga isanya. Yoashi nayali yololela ng'hano za mafuta ga zeituni. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Shitilayi, Mshaloni, nayali yovilolela vilundo vya misenga jiwele najali jidimigwa ako Shaloni. Shafati, mwana wa Adilayi, nayali yovilolela vilundo vya misenga jiwele najali jidimigwa kuli mibindi. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Obili, Mwishimaeli, nayali yololela ngamiya. Yedeya, Mmelonoti, nayali yojilolela midogowi. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Yasisi, Mhagali, nayali yololela vilundo vya ming'holo na mhene. Awo weng'ha nawali vilongozi wa kulolela lufufu lwa mndewa Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wanji walingumtanza mndewa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Yonatani, mng'holoze mndewa Daudi, nayali yomtanza mndewa kwa kumlonjela mbuli zilivinji, nayali kahi muwanzi na yalingwandika. Yenieli, mwana wa Hakimoni, nayali yowalangusa wana wa mndewa. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Ahitofeli nayali yomtanza mndewa kwa kumlonjela mbuli zilivinji na Hushayi, Mwaliki, nayali goloko wa mndewa. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Ahitofeli loyabagame, Yehoyada, mwana wa Benaya na Abiatali nawahola honhu hake kwa kumtanza mndewa kwa kumlonjela mbuli zilivinji. Yoabu nayali chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi wa mndewa.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga Daudi galinguwala ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Mndewa Daudi nakawachema vilongozi wakulu weng'ha wa Isilaeli wekungajize ako Yelusalemu. Vilongozi awo ndo vilongozi wakulu wa nhanzi zeng'ha na vilongozi wa wakulu wa wamizi wa mndewa na vilongozi wa wakulu wa maelufu na wa mamiya na vilongozi walingulolela lufufu lweng'ha na migongolo ja mndewa na wanage, hamwe na vilongozi wa ng'handa ya chiundewa na wazidahe kitowa ngondo na wamizi weng'ha wazidahe. <verse eid="1CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Hamba mndewa Daudi nakema na kulonga, “Hemwe wang'holozangu na wanhu wa heni, mnyhulichize. Nanuwila kuzenga ng'handa leka iwe honhu ha kuwika isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha kuwa honhu ha kuwichila magulu ga Nguluwi wa hetwe kuli isanduku alyo. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Ila Nguluwi nakandemeza kwa vila nda munhu wa kitowa ngondo na kwa vila nambohola danda nyinji. <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli nakanyhagula hali ivyazi lya mhaza wa heni leka ndiwe mndewa wa Isilaeli mazuwa gose. Nakaihagula nhanzi ya Yuda leka ilongoze na kulawa kuli nhanzi ayo, nakalihagula ivyazi lya mhaza wa heni na hali wana wa mhaza wa heni, nakanojezwa kumbika leka ndiwe mndewa wa Isilaeli yeng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha heni wana wenji na hali wana awo weng'ha nakamhagula Solomoni leka yekalise hali chigoda cha undewa wa heye Mkulu Nguluwi, leka yailongoze Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />“Mkulu Nguluwi nakandonjela, ‘Mwanago Solomoni ndo yawele konzenjela ng'handa na lugagala lwa heni, kwa vila nandimhagula heye leka yawe mwana wa heni, nani ndowa mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Ndowimiza nzinzili undewa wa heye mazuwa gose wone kolutilila kibatilila mizilo ja heni na malajizo ga heni kota vyoyalingudita lehano.’ <verse eid="1CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />Ahyo lelo, ndanguwalajiza hali Waisilaeli weng'ha na nhing'hano ayi ya Mkulu Nguluwi, kuno Nguluwi wa hetwe yohulika kota mibatilile malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe, leka isi ayi inojile iwe ya hemwe na kuwalechela walelwa wa hemwe, leka iwe uhalizi wa hewo wa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />“Nagwe Solomoni, mwana wa heni, umzele Nguluwi wa mhaza wa hegwe na umkolele mijito kwa nhumbula ya hegwe yeng'ha na kwa kunuwila kumwe, heye Mkulu Nguluwi kangupugajizaga nhumbula na kangukuzela kunuwila na kiwika goya kwa wanhu. Houmpala, komona, ila wone umleche, naye kokutoza kutali na heye mazuwa gose. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Wilolele lelo, kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakakuhagula leka uzenje Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, iwele yowa ndo honhu ha chiuyeng'ha. Uwe uzidahe na udite mijito joupegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Ahyo Daudi nakamha Solomoni lamani ya chituka cha Ng'handa ya Nguluwi na ng'handa zake na ng'hano zake na milingo jake na vihengo vyake vya mgati na honhu ha chigoda cha uhanyisi. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Nakamha malajizo geng'ha goyejesile mnhumbula kuwala lugagala lwa Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi na vihengo vilinguzunguluta lugagala na ng'hano za ng'handa ya Nguluwi na ng'hano za kuwichila vinhu viwichigwe chiuyeng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Nakamha kahi malajizo kuwala mijito ja watambika na Walawi na kwa chiwalo cha mijito jeng'ha ja kuli Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. Nakamha kahi malajizo kuwala vinhu vyeng'ha vya kufugamila vya kuli Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Nakamha chasi cha zahabu ilinguganigwa kugongomanyila vinhu vyeng'ha vya zahabu vya kuli mijito jilivinji na chasi cha sendi ilinguganigwa kuli mijito jilivinji <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />na chasi cha zahabu kwa chiwalo cha vinhu vya kuwichila chenje na vyenje vyake na chasi cha zahabu cha chila chinhu cha kuwichila chenje na vyenje vyake na chasi cha sendi cha kugongomanyila chinhu cha kuwichila chenje na vyenje vyake kwa kiwhana na mijito ja chila chinhu cha kuwichila chenje <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />na chasi cha zahabu kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila chisaga cha kuwichila mibumunda jiwichigwe chiuyeng'ha na chasi cha sendi kwa chiwalo cha chisaga cha sendi. <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />Nakalavya kahi malajizo kwa chiwalo cha chasi cha zahabu inojile ilinguganigwa kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila uma na mibuli na vizombe na kahi chasi cha zahabu na sendi chilinguganigwa kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila visaye <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />na chasi cha zahabu inojile kwa chiwalo chakugongomanyila honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha kufunyizila ubani. Nakamha kahi malajizo kuwala mutuka wa zahabu wa vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa viwele navigonzola mabawa na kuligubika isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />Ago geng'ha, mndewa Daudi nakagawika hazelu kwa gandichigwe goyapegwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. Mijito jeng'ha jikoleche kwa kuwinza lamani ayo.<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Hamba, mndewa Daudi nakamlonjela Solomoni, mwanage, “Wime nzinzili na uzidahe, ukole mijito aji. Uleche kudumba ne kuwa na lunhwinhwi. Nguluwi, Mkulu Nguluwi, yawele ndo Nguluwi wa heni, ka hamwe na hegwe. Hokuleka ila kowa hamwe na hegwe mbaka housinda mijito jeng'ha jilinguganigwa kukoleka kuli Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Watambika na Walawi nawawichilwa mijito jowalinguganigwa kukola kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Wakola mijito wawele na uwanzi wa chila mbuli wowa goya kukutanza na wanhu weng'ha hamwe na vilongozi wa hewo wowinza malajizo ga hegwe.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Ndolendole kwa chiwalo cha kuzenga ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Mndewa Daudi nakawalonjela wala wanhu weng'ha wawele nawekungajiza, “Mwana wa heni Solomoni, heye yawele Nguluwi nakamhagula, yang'hali mdodo na kahela luhala lwa kuhega. Mijito aji ndo jing'hang'hala, kwa vila ng'handa ayi iwele heye koizenga, haiwele kwa chiwalo cha munhu, ila ndo kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Lelo, nandikangaza kwa ludali lwa heni lweng'ha kuwika ng'hano ya vinhu vya kuzenjela ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Vinhu avyo ndo zahabu, kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila vinhu vya zahabu na sendi, kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila vinhu vya sendi na shaba, kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila vinhu vya shaba na chuma, kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila vinhu vya chuma na migodi kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanyila vinhu vya migodi. Kahi nandikuwichila goya chasi chikulu cha maganga galinguchemigwa salidoniki na maganga galinguchemigwa kilisopilaso na maganga ga sendi nyinji gawele na lanji zilivinji na mabwe na maganga galingupulika. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Kahi, mzidi wa vinhu vyeng'ha vyondivilavile kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa yelile, ndanayo ng'hano ya heni ya zahabu na sendi. Kwa vila ndanguigana ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa heni, lelo ndanguilavya kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa heni. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />Ng'hano ayo ndo ya kilo lachi imwe na elufu mbili (102,000) za zahabu kulawa Ofili na kilo lachi mbili na elufu makumi gadatu na nane (238,000) za sendi kwa chiwalo cha kunoliga ng'hanzi <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />na kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja zahabu na mijito ja sendi na kwa mijito jeng'ha jiwele jokoleka na wawanzi. Lelo, whaani yalingugana kumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi lehano?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Ahyo wakulu wa ng'holo na vilongozi wa nhanzi za Isilaeli na wakulu wa wamizi maelufu na mamiya na vilongozi wa mijito ja mndewa nawalavya kwa kunuwila kwa hewo. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nawalavya kilo lachi imwe na elufu makumi sita na gahano (165,000) za zahabu na kilo lachi zidatu na elufu makumi gadatu (330,000) za sendi na kilo lachi sita (600,000) za shaba na kilo milioni zidatu na lachi tatu (3,300,000) za chuma. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Chila yumwe yawele nayali na maganga ga sendi nyinji nakagalavya leka gawichigwe kuli ng'hano ya Mkulu Nguluwi hali ulongozi wa Yehieli, Mgelishoni. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Ahyo wanhu nawasangalala kwa vila nawamlavila Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula za hewo wawo na kwa kunuwila kwa hewo wawo, naye mndewa Daudi nakasangalala ng'hatu.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kangumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Daudi nakamtogola Mkulu Nguluwi hali nhing'hano yeng'ha yolonga, “Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli mhaza wa hetwe, utogoligwe kulawa mazuwa gose mbaka mazuwa gose. <verse eid="1CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ukulu na ludali na mong'ho na kusumya na undewa na vyeng'ha viwele kilanga na muisi ndo vya hegwe. Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi undewa ndo wa hegwe, nagwe nakwinuligwa kusinda vinhu vyeng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Lufufu na kuhulichizwa vyangulawa kwa hegwe, hegwe ndo ulingulongoza vinhu vyeng'ha. Mmoko mwa hegwe hana ludali na mong'ho, leka kuwenula na kuwapa mong'ho weng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Lelo, gwa Nguluwi wa hetwe, twangulonga malumbo na kulitogola itagwa lya hegwe liwele na ukulu.<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />“Ila, heni nda whaani na wanhu wa heni ndo whaani, mbaka tukupe chinhu? Kwa vila vinhu vyeng'ha vyangulawa kwa hegwe, natukulavila vinhu viwele navilawa kwa hegwe. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Hetwe twa wajenzi hali hegwe na twa kuli majendo kota vyowawele wasekulu wa hetwe weng'ha. Mazuwa ga hetwe muisi ndo kota lubehelo lulingukola, haduhu kitumbila kwa kikala kwa mhela winji. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, kwa winji weng'ha wa vinhu vyeng'ha viwele natukulavila kwa chiwalo cha kuzenga ng'handa kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya hegwe lyelile, navilawa mmoko mwa hegwe, navyo vyeng'ha ndo vya hegwe. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Nguluwi wa heni, ndanguvizela kota hegwe kwanguijezaga nhumbula na kwangunojezwa na kugoloka. Vinhu avi vyeng'ha nandavya kwa kunuwila kwa heni na kwa nhumbula igoloche. Nani lelo ndanguwona wanhu wa hegwe wawele hano, vyowalingukulavila kwa kusangalala na kwa kunuwila kwa hewo wawo. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hetwe Abulahamu na Isaka na Isilaeli, mazuwa gose uwiche maya aga mgati mwa nhumbula za wanhu wa hegwe na uzidite nhumbula za hewo ziwe za kukundigwa hali hegwe. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Umtambichize mwana wa heni Solomoni leka yebatilile mizilo ja hegwe na malajizo ga hegwe na kwamula kwa hegwe kwa nhumbula ya heye yeng'ha, leka yadite geng'ha na yazenje ng'handa ayi ya chiundewa iwele vinhu vyake vya kuzenjela nandiviwika goya.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Hamba mndewa Daudi nakailonjela nhing'hano yeng'ha, “Mumtogole Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe.” Weng'ha wawele nawekungajiza hala nawamtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hewo, nawamfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi na kumha lutogo mndewa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Zuwa lya keli nawamlavila Mkulu Nguluwi ndolendole na nhambiko za kulakazwa, ziwele ndo mibuguma elufu imwe (1,000) na ming'holo milume elufu imwe (1,000) na ming'holo myana elufu imwe (1,000), hamwe na nhambiko za hewo za chakunwa na nhambiko zinji nyinji ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Lelo, zuwa alyo nawalya na kunwa kwa kusangalala hali Mkulu Nguluwi. Nawamdita Solomoni, mwana wa Daudi, leka yawe mndewa kahi. Nawambakaliza mafuta leka yawe chilongozi kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi na Sadoki yawe mtambika. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Ahyo Solomoni nakekalisa hali chigoda cha undewa chiwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakachimiza nzinzili, honhu ha Daudi, mhaza wa heye. Mbuli za heye nazilutilila goya na wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli nawamhulichiza. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Vilongozi wakulu weng'ha na wazidahe, hamwe na wana weng'ha wa mndewa Daudi, nawalagana kota womhulichiza mndewa Solomoni. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamdita Solomoni yatogoligwe na Waisilaeli weng'ha, nakamha ukulu wa chiundewa uwele haduhu mndewa yoneche yamlongole yawele nakapegwa.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Daudi, mwana wa Yese, nayali mndewa wa Isilaeli yeng'ha. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Nakalongoza kuli Isilaeli kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane. Kuli mhela awo nakalongoza Hebuloni kwa miyaka saba na Yelusalemu kwa miyaka makumi gadatu na jidatu. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Nakabagama yawele na miyaka minji, yawele na lufufu na lutogo. Solomoni mwanage, nakawa mndewa honhu hake. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Mbuli za mndewa Daudi kulawa mwaluko mbaka kuduma kwa heye, nazandichigwa kuli kukumbuchila kwa mloli Samweli na kuli kukumbuchila kwa mloli Natani na kuli kukumbuchila kwa mloli Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />Mbuli azo zanguwala ulongozi wa heye na ludali lwake na mbuli ziwele nazimfika na ziwele naziwafika Waisilaeli na ziwele kahi naziwafika wandewa weng'ha wa kuli isi zinji zeng'ha.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>